  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Samwel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Samwel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Samwel</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Samwel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Defid Akop abaña Ñkpa Sọọl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Ke Sọọl amaakekpa, nọ Defid akekweeñe adiwot mbon Amalek, anye amaatịmme anyọñ adiba usen iba ke Siklak. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Ke ayọhọ usen ita, awo amaato nnaaekọñ Sọọl adi, asịne ñwaiya afọñ ye ntọñ ke iwuod. Anye akediwuọ iso Defid, anye amaaduọ ke isọñ anyʌñ atuak iwuod anọ Defid.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Defid amaabịp anye abo, “uke ke afo ato adi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ñkefeghe mbọkkọ nto nnaaekọñ Isrel.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Defid amaabịp anye abo, “Ndọkkọ miin, nsoo ikido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Awo ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ideen ado emaefeeñe ekpọñ iso ekọñ. Uwak ammọ emaeduọññọ enyʌñ ekpañña. Ndin Sọọl ye ayịn amọ Yọnatan emaekpañña.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Ndin Defid amaabo akparawa a-akebenne etob ami adi ate, “Afo anam die adiọọñọ ke Sọọl ye ayịn amọ Yọnatan ekpañña?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Akparawa ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ñkeba ke Abod Kilboa,” adidem Sọọl amaaba do ñko, abere ke eduad amọ, mme sariọd ekọñ ye mme andiwad ammọ ekesʌk ebịne anye adudu-adudu. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Ke ini anye akekannake anyen añkịt miin, anye amañkoot miin, ami mmaanyʌñ mbo, Nsoo ke ami ñkeme adinam unọọ fiin?<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />“Anye amambịp miin, ‘Afo ado anie?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Ami mmaabọọrọ ‘Ami ndo awo Amalek.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Ndin anye amambo miin ate, ‘Da mi ñkpere miin nyʌñ ñwot miin, sia ami mba ke akpọsọñ ubiak ñkpa, ado uwem asʌk ambaaba miin ke idem.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Do ndin, ami mmaada ke ñkañ amọ ñnyʌñ ñwot anye, sia mmaadiọọñọ ke sia anye amaakeduọ, ke idiiduuho. Ndin ami mmaayaara anyanya ke iwuod amọ ñnyʌñ nsio anye ñkpọubọk ke ubọk, ammọ ke ñkoono ami nsọk abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Akema Defid ye mme afịd awo se ikibañña ye anye emaesịññe afọñ ammọ ewai. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Ammọ emaefʌhọ, etua enyʌñ etre ndidia tutu ndubiayio ebaña Sọọl ye ayịn amọ Yọnatan, enyʌñ ebaña mbonekọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọk Isrel, sia ammọ emaekpañña afai ato akañkañ.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Akem Defid amaabịp akparawa a-akebenne etob ado adi abo, “Afo ato uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ndo ayịn asenawo, awo Amalek.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Defid amaabịp anye abo, “Nsoo ido ntak afo umuukunieghe mbaak adibenne ubọk mfo ñwot awo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakeyet adan anịm?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ndin Defid amaakoot keed ke atu mme awo amọ anyʌñ adọkkọ anye abo, “Kaa, ke wot anye!” Akparawa ado amaawot awo Amalek ado, ndin anye amaakpa. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Sia Defid amaadọkkọ anye abo ate, “Yak iyiib mfo udodo fiin ke iwuod. Sia inua mfo amaado ntiense unọ fiin idaha afo akebooho, ‘Ami ñkewot anye ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakeyet adan anịm.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eseeme Defid Ke Abaña Sọọl ye Yọnatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Ndin Defid amaaseeme aseeme ami abaña Sọọl mme ayịn amọ Yọnatan, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />anye amaanyʌñ anọ uyio abo yak ekpeep mbon Yuda aseeme utịgha ami nọ adọnọ ammọ (ewet ami esịn ke Ñwed Yasaa):<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“O! Isrel, e-ewot edob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edob mi ada anọ uku awo.</char></note> edot ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie mfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Mbọm, mbon uko e-eduọññọ!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Ndufo ikiitañ ami ke Kad,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ikiibʌk ami ke mme efaak Askelọn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">mbaak nditọ ibaan Filistia edidat esịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">mbaak nditọ ibaan mbon ake imiifọọrọke edʌd edidaara.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Mme Ikpọabod Kilboa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ke ndufo enie mbara me edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">ke ukodedịm aduọkkọ ke isọñ anọọ inwañ ndufo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ke inwañ mfo anwịm mfịd se ekama enọ mme enọ </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Sia do ke ekesuenne atuekọñ mbon uko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">atuekọñ Sọọl, a-adan imiiyereke aba.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />“To ke iyiib mme akpañña afai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">to ke abʌkidem mbon uko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">utịgha Yọnatan ikitịmmeke aba idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">akañkañ Sọọl ikinyʌññọ itịmme idi ukpọk.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sọọl ye Yọnatan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">ke ayio uwem ekemaama enyʌñ ekpono ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">ndin ke ñkpa ammọ ikidiaññake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Ammọ emaesọp usọp ekan ntrukpuum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">emaenie adudu ekan ekpe.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Nditọ ibaan Isrel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">itua ayịd inọ Sọọl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">a-akisịnne ndufo ndad-ndad afọñ mme nti ñkpọ ke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">a-akedọññọ mme afọñidem ndufo ye mbọbọ ake kold.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Mbọm, naña mbon uko eduọññọ ke ekọñ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yọnatan akpa ke afai anaa ke ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ndufo.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Esịd mmi abʌññọ unọ fiin, Yọnatan ayịneka mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">afo akedo adima ufan mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Ima a-afo akenieghe annọọ miin akedo utịppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">akan ima ibaan.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Mbọm, naña mbon uko eduọññọ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Mme ñkpọekọñ enyʌñ etak!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eyet Defid Adan nte Adidem ke Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Amaakedikem ke ini, Defid amaabịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo. “Ado se ami ndọọk ñkaa keed ke mme abio Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ anye abo, “Dọọk kaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Defid amaabịp abo, “Ñka uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ anye abo, “Kaa Hibrọn.”<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Do ndin Defid amaadakka akaa do ye mme anwaan amọ iba, Ahinoam awonwaan Yesriil ye Abikel, ebekpa Nabal awonwaan Kamel. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Defid ñko amaasaña ye mme ideen amọ e-ekebaaha ye anye, ammọ keedekeed ekenyʌñ esaña ye mme ubon ammọ, ammọ emaenyʌñ ekedʌñọ ke mme abio Hibrọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Akema, ideen Yuda emaedi ke Hibrọn, emaediyet Defid adan enịm nte adidem ke esiin Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Ke emaekedọkkọ Defid ebo ke akedo mbon idʌñ Yabes Kilied ekeben Sọọl ebuuk, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />Defid amaadọñ mme isʌñutom abo ekedọkkọ mbon Yabes Kilied ebo, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> idiọñ naña ndufo ekewọt Sọọl eteufọk ndufo mfọn ke edibuuk anye. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iwọt ndufo mfọn ye akpanikọ, ami ñko ñyaiwọt ndufo ukem mfọn ado ato ke se ndufo ekenam ami. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Do ndin, ikop adudu ye uko, sia ete ufọk ndufo Sọọl akpa, ndin mbon Yuda eñyet miin adan enịm nte adidem ammọ.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekọñ ke Ufọk Defid ye ke Ufọk Sọọl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Akema, Abna ayịn Nee, adaiso ekọñ Sọọl, amaadat Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl adian idem anyʌñ aben anye akanna adika ke Mahanaim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Anye amaanam Is-Bosed ado adidem ke Kilied, Asuri, Yesriil, ye ke Ifrem, Benyamin ye ke afịd Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl akedo isua aba ke ini anye akedooho adidem ke Isrel, ndin anye akekara ke isua iba. Ado esiin Yuda ekeda ye Defid. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Defid akekara nte adidem Yuda ke Hibrọn ke isua itiaba ye afiọñ itiokeed.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abna ayịn Nee ye ideen Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl emaekpọñ Mahanaim ekaa ke Kibiọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoab ayịn Seruya ye ideen Defid emaewuọ ekesoobo ammọ ke ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ Kibiọn. Atu mbon awo keed emaebono ke mbeñ ñkpọdiọhọ mmọọñ keed, atu mfen enyʌñ ebono ke mbeñ uko.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ndin Abna amaabo Yoab ate, “Yak inam nọ ubaak ñkparawa ami edakka eda enyʌñ enwana ubọk ye ubọk ke iso ñnyịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoab amaanyịmme abo, “Afọn, yak ammọ enam ntoro.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Do ndin ammọ emaedaaña eda, enyʌñ ebat ammọ, ekedo awo duob mme iba ke ukañ Benyamin ye Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl, duob mme iba ñko ke ukañ Defid. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Ndin awo keedekeed amaamʌm awo anwan amọ ke iwuod, anyʌñ anək ikwa amọ asịn ke ñkan awo anwan amọ, ndin afịd ammọ eduọññọ atọ keed. Ekekoot itie ado ke Kibiọn Hedkad Hasurim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hedkad Hasurim awuọñọ inwañ akañkañ me inwañ anwan</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Ekọñ amaanekke asọñ usen ado, ndin ikọd Defid emaekan Abna ye nditọ Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Nditọ ideen Seruya ita ekeba do: Yoab, Abisai ye Asahel. Asahel akesọp ñkpad nte edob ikọd. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asahel amaabịne Abna, iwakkake idʌk nnasia me ufiin naña akebịneke anye. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abna amaakanna anyen ke edem anyʌñ abịp abo, “Afo Asahel adodo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Anye amaabọọrọ abo, “Ami ke ado.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ndin Abna amaabo anye ate, “Kanna dʌk nnasia me ufiin; mʌm akparawa keed nyʌñ bọi anye ñkpọekọñ amọ.” Ado Asahel ikinyịmmeke aditre adibịne anye.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abna amaamaana adʌt Asahel utọñ abo, “Kumbịne miin aba! Ntak ami ñkpuwotto fiin-e? Ndiikan die nse ayịneka mfo Yoab ke iso?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Ado Asahel ikinyịmmeke aditre adibịne anye, ndin Abna amaakịm Asahel ekpa ke itak eduad, eduad amaatịppe ato ke edem amọ awuọ. Asahel amaaduọ anyʌñ akpa ke itie ado. Afịd awo emaesọñ eda ekediwuọ itie ado Asahel akeduọhọ akpa.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Do ndin Yoab ye Abisai emaebịne Abna, tutu ekewuọ abod Amaa, ke idaha utịn akaaha isop, a-akpereke Kia ke usʌñ a-akaaha ndoon ake Kibiọn. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Ndin ikọd Benyamin emaetuak eda ye Abna. Ammọ emaediana ekappa edo atu keed edudak ke anyọñ abod.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Ado Abna amaabọñ akoot Yoab ate, “Ado nte akañkañ ana akaiso asobo ke nsi-nsi? Ado nte afo udiọọñọke ke ñkpọ ami adiikitre ke ndusuara? Idooho ndin se afo abo ikọd mfo etre edibịne nditọete ammọ, mbon Isrel?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoab amaabọọrọ ate, “Ke akpanikọ, adaña nte Abasi aduuho uwem, akpedo afo ukusioho uyio, ikọd mmi ekpekaaka iso ebịne ammọ tutu ubakusen.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Do ndin Yoab amaafịt adukpoñ, ndin afịd udịmekọñ emaesọñ eda; ammọ ikibịneke Isrel aba, ammọ ikinyʌññọ inwana aba.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abna ye afịd ikọd amọ emaesaña ke udịm afịd akonayio ado ekeboiyo Araba. Ammọ emaekaaña eboiyo Yọdan ke usiere ubakusen enyʌñ ekewuọ Mahanaim.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Akema, Yoab amaatre adibịne Abna anyʌñ akoot afịd mbonekọñ amọ abok. Ke amaaboiyo Asahel, awo ikikịtte mbon Defid awo duob mme usʌkkeed. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Ado ikọd Defid emaewot mbon Benyamin ikie ita mme ata (360) e-ekebaaha ye Abna. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Ammọ emaeben Asahel ekebuuk ke udi ete amọ ke Betlehem. Ndin Yoab ye ikọd amọ emaesaña ke udịm afịd akonayio enyʌñ ekewuọ Hibrọn ke usiere.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Ekọñ ke ufọọd ufọk Sọọl ye ufọk Defid amaaba akpeene. Defid amaakaa iso akop uko ke ini ufọk Sọọl akekoppo mmemidem ke usen ke usen.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Emaemaan nditọ ideen enọ Defid ke Hibrọn:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:2">Akpan amọ akedo Amnọn ayịn Ahinoam a-aketooho Yesriil;<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Abikel, ebekpa Nabal awonwaan Kamel akeman Kileeb udọ amọ; ayọhọ awodeen ita akedo Absalọm a-adooho Maaka ayịn awonwaan Talmai adidem Kesọọ akeman;<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />ayọhọ inaañ, Adọniya ayịn Hakịd;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 3:4">ayọhọ ition, Sefatia ayịn Abital;<verse eid="2SA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />ñko ayọhọ itiokeed, Itreem ayịn anwaan Defid Ekla akeman.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 3:5" />
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 3:5">Ekeman ammọ enọ Defid ke Hibrọn.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abna Awọññọ Akediana ye Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ke ini anwan akebaaha ke atu ufọk Sọọl ye ufọk Defid, Abna akesʌk asọọñọ itie amọ akama ke ufọk Sọọl. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sọọl amaanie anwaan esa a-akekereke Rispa, ayịn awonwaan Aiya. Akem Is-Bosed amaabo Abna, “Nsoo ido nọ afo akena anwaan esa ete mmi?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Se Is-Bosed aketañ amaanekke ayat Abna esịd. Ndin Abna amaabọọrọ ate, “Ado nte ami ndo iwuod ewa ke ukañ Yuda? Tutu ke usen mfịn ami nsʌk nnanam ñwaidem nnọ ufọk ete mfo Sọọl ye ubon amọ ye mme ufan amọ. Ami unọọhọ ufen ke eduyaak fiin nnọọ Defid. Ado idahami afo amendot miin uyio ke mmenam idiọọkñkpọ ke abaña awonwaan ami! <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Yak adiọọk anọ Abna, ami mmennamma nnọ Defid se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ anọ anye <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />ñnyʌñ mbọ ufọk Sọọl itie adidem ndin nnịm ebekpo nnọ Defid ke afịd Isrel ye Yuda, tọọñọ ke Daan tutu akewuọ Beeseba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Is-Bosed ikideeghede itañ ikọ ye Abna aba, sia anye akebaabaak Abna.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Do ndin, Abna amaadọñ mme isʌñutom ke iwuod amọ ekebo Defid ete, “Anie awo anie isọñ ami? Nam edioomo ye ami, ndin ami ñyaunwam mben afịd esiin Isrel ñkappa unọ.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Defid amaabo ate, “Afọn ntoro. Ami ñyaanam edioomo ye afo. Ado, ñyem afo anam ñkpọ keed annọ miin: Kuudi iso mmi tutu afo asaña ye Maikal ayịn awonwaan Sọọl ke ini afo adiighe adiñkịt.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ndin Defid amaadọñ mme isʌñutom asọk Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl, abịp abo, “Nnọ miin anwaan mmi Maikal, ake ami ñkekpeeghe ñkpọ ndọ ke ekọmudua idem ideen nditọ Filistia ikie.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ke ntoro, Is-Bosed amaanọ uyio anyʌñ anam ekebọ Maikal ke ubọk ebe amọ Paltiel ayịn Lais. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Ado ebe amọ amaakeene anye ke edem, asaña atua tutu akewuọ Bahurim. Ndin Abna amaabo anye, “Tịmme nyọñ ufọk!” Ndin anye amaatịmme anyọñ.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abna amaakọọk iwuod ye mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel anyʌñ abo ate, “Tọọñọ ako ndufo emaeyem edinam Defid ado adidem inọ ndufo. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Inam ntoro idahami! Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanwọñọ anọ Defid abo ate, ‘Adiito ke Defid awo mmi, ami ñyaanyaaña ikọd mmi Isrel nsio ke ubọk mbon Filistia ye ke ubọk afịd mme usua ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abna amaanyʌñ akaa ke idem amọ ikpọọñ akeneme ye mme ubon Benyamin. Ndin anye amaakaa ke Hibrọn akedọkkọ Defid afịd ñkpọ se Isrel ye afịd esiin Benyamin ekeyem anye anam. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Ke ini Abna, a-akesañake ye awo edịb adikịt Defid ke Hibrọn, Defid amaanam usọrọ anọ anye ye ikọd amọ. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Ndin Abna amaadọkkọ Defid ate, “Yak ami nsọp ndakka ñkekoot afịd esiin Isrel mbok nnọ abọọñ mmi adidem, nọ ammọ enam edioomo ye afo, nọ afo ñko anyʌñ ada ukara ke afịd se esịd mfo ayem.” Ndin Defid amaasio Abna unyọñ, anye anyʌñ akaa ke emem.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoab Awot Abna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Ikikpeeneke ikọd Defid ye Yoab emaeto utañ mbịme ekọñ edi, enyʌñ ekama ataa uwak mbịme enyọñ. Ado Abna ikibaaha aba ke Hibrọn, sia Defid amaasio anye unyọñ, anye amaanyʌñ anyọñ ke emem. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Ke ini Yoab ye afịd mbonekọñ se ikiba ye anye emaekediwuọ, emaedọkkọ anye ebo ke Abna ayịn Nee amaadi abịne adidem, ye naña adidem akesio anye unyọñ nọ anye anyọñ ke emem.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Ndin Yoab amaakaa iso adidem akebo, “Nsoo ke afo anam ami? Sese, Abna amaadi ubịne fiin. Afo akenam die ayaak anye anyọñ! Idahami anye anyọñ! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Afo amediọọñọ Abna ayịn Nee; anye akedi adidubiaña fiin ñnyʌñ ñyep mme usʌñ mfo, ñnyʌñ ndiọọñọ afịd ñkpọ se afo anam.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Ndin Yoab amaakpọñ Defid anyʌñ adọñ mme isʌñutom ebịne Abna, ammọ emaenyʌñ eben anye eto edi ke itie ube mmọọñ Sira. Ado Defid ikidiọọñọke. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Ke Abna amaaketịmme anyọñ adi Hibrọn, Yoab amaaben anye awuọ akpọñ mme awo akaa akedʌk ke esịd akwere, anam nte ayem adineme nneme ye anye. Do ke Yoab akekịm anye idịb, ndin anye amaakpa, ke usiene iyiib ayịneka amọ Asahel.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Akema, ke ini Defid akekoppo abaña ñkpọ ami, anye amaabo ate, “Ami ye ubọọñ mmi imisana ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iyiib Abna ayịn Nee ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Yak iyiib amọ adoro ke iwuod Yoab ye afịd ufọk amọ. Yak ubon Yoab akuutre adinie awo inia me akpamfia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru, akpamfia ada anọ udọñọ a-ataaha awo ke ikpọkidem.</char></note> me awo a-anʌhọke akama esañ me a-akpaaha ke akañkañ me ananake ndidia.”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />(Yoab ye ayịneka amọ Abisai ekewot Abna sia Abna amaawot ayịneka ammọ Asahel ke iso ekọñ ke Kibiọn).<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Akem Defid amaabo Yoab ye afịd mbon se ikiba ye anye, “Iwai afọñidem ndufo inyʌñ isịne afọñ mfʌhọ isaaña itua ke iso akpo Abna.” Adidem Defid ke idem amọ akesaña ke edem akpo. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Ammọ emaebuuk Abna ke Hibrọn, ndin adidem amaatua uyio asọñ ke itie udi Abna. Afịd awo emaetuaha ñko.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Adidem amaakwọ ikwọ aseeme ami anọ Abna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Me akpena Abna akekpa naña abiad mbed akpa?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Awo ikubọppọ fiin ubọk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">Awo ikusịnne ñkpọnọ ke ukod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Afo akekpa nte awo akpa ke ubọk idiọọk awo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Ndin afịd awo emaemaana etọọñọ ayịd ke ntak amọ.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Akekem afịd ammọ emaedikpeiye Defid ebo yak adia ndidia mbemiso ayio akịm; ado Defid amaanwọñọ, abo, “Yak Abasi anam ye ami naña anye ama, naña akpedodoppo, adieke ami ntabake uyo me ñkpọ mfen mbemiso utịn asop!”<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Afịd awo emaekịt enyʌñ enem esịd; ke akpanikọ, afịd ñkpọ se adidem akenam amaanem ammọ. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ndin ke usen ado, afịd awo se ikiba do ye afịd Isrel emaediọọñọ ke adidem Defid ikinieghe ubọk ke ñkpa Abna ayịn Nee.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Akem adidem amaadọkkọ ikọd amọ abo, “Ado nte ndufo idiọọñọke ke adaiso ekọñ ye ekamba awo akpa mfịn ke Isrel? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Ndin, ke mfịn ami, akpesʌkado eñyette miin adan ami ndo adidem, idem ammem miin, ñko nditọ Seruya ami esọñ adudu eñkan miin. Ado yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asio idiọọk awo usiene akemme ye idiọọk ido amọ!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ewot Is-Bosed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ke ini Is-Bosed ayịn Sọọl akekoppo abo ke Abna amaakpa ke Hibrọn, ukpọñ amaabọkkọ anye, afịd Isrel ñko ekeba ke ayeemensia. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ayịn awodeen Sọọl amaanie awo iba ekesidaha iso ke mbịme ekọñ. Keed akekere Baana, keed akere Rekab; ammọ ekedo nditọ ideen Rimọn awo Beerod ake esiin Benyamin, ebat Beerod esịn ke esiin Benyamin, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />sia mbon Beerod ekefeeñe ekedʌñọ ke Kitaim enyʌñ esʌk edʌñọ do nte isenawo tutu usen mfịn.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />(Yọnatan ayịn Sọọl amaanie ayịn awodeen a-akedooho mbʌñọ ke naña ukod iba. Anye akedo isua ition ke ini etob Sọọl ye Yọnatan aketooho Yesriil adisịm. Adeb amọ amaaben anye afeghe, ado naña anye ayemme idakka usọp-usọp, anye amaaduọ anyʌñ ado abʌññọ. Anyịñ amọ akedo Mefibosed).<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Ndin Rekab ye Baana, nditọ ideen Rimọn awo Beerod, emaedakka ekaa ufọk Is-Bosed, enyʌñ ekewuọ do ke ataa ufiob uweemeayio, ke ini anye akebaaha ke nduọkadudu uweeme amọ. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Ammọ emaedʌk ekaa esịd ufọk enam nte eka adikidat abakpa mbakara, ado ammọ emaekekịm anye ke ekpa. Ndin Rekab ye ayịneka amọ Baana emaedịbe ewuọñọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="2SA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Ammọ emaedʌk esịd ufọk amọ ke ini Is-Bosed akenaaha ke ikʌk ke ubeed nnaa amọ. Ammọ emaekekịm enyʌñ ewot anye ema, emaekpịkke iwuod amọ. Ammọ emaekama iwuod ado esaña afịd akonayio ke usʌñ Araba. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Ammọ emaeben iwuod Is-Bosed esọk Defid ke Hibrọn ekebo anye adidem ete, “Se iwuod Is-Bosed mi ayịn Sọọl, awo asua mfo, a-akeyemme aduwot fiin. Ke mfịn ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asio usiene iwuod abọọñ mme adidem mmi ke abaña Sọọl ye nditọ amọ.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Defid amaabọọrọ Rekab mme ayịneka amọ Baana, nditọ Rimọn awo Beerod, ate, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, akemfakka miin asio ke afịd mfịna, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />ke ini awo akendọkkọke abo, ‘Sọọl akpa,’ akekere abo ke iben eti etob insọk, ami mmaamʌm anye ñwot ke Siklak. Utịb ami ñkenọọhọ anye ke etob amọ akedo ado! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Nwaanwa dise, ke ini mbon ibak ewotto awo ammiidueghe isob ke ufọk amọ ye ke ikʌk amọ, nte ami ndiibịppe iyiib amọ ke ubọk ndufo ñnyʌñ isio ndufo mfep ke iso isọñ!”<verse eid="2SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Do ndin Defid amaanọ ikọd amọ uyio, nọ enyʌñ ewot ammọ. Emaekpok ammọ ubọk mme ukod enyʌñ ekọọñ ukpịd idem ammọ ke eto ke Hibrọn. Ado ikọd Defid emaeben iwuod Is-Bosed ekebuuk ke udi Abna ke Hibrọn.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Defid Ado Adidem ke Afịd Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Afịd esiin Isrel emaedisoobo iwuod ye Defid ke Hibrọn enyʌñ ebo anye, “Ñnyịn ido abʌk ye iyiib mfo. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Ke mme usen edem ke idaha Sọọl akedooho adidem ñnyịn, afo akedo awo a-akesidatta Isrel usʌñ akaa ekọñ. Ñko <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaudọkkọ fiin ate, ‘Afo ayaado andikpeme ikọd mmi Isrel, ndin afo ayaado andikara ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ke ini afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel emaekedisoobo ye Adidem Defid ke Hibrọn, anye adidem amaanam edioomo ye ammọ ke Hibrọn ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ammọ emaeyet Defid adan nte adidem ke Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Defid akedo isua edịb mme duob ke ini anye akedooho adidem, anye ñko akekara ke isua aba. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ke Hibrọn anye akekara isua itiaba mme afiọñ itiokeed ke Yuda, anyʌñ akara isua edịb mme duob mme ita ke Yeruselem ye ke afịd Isrel mme Yuda.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Akan Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Adidem ye mbonekọñ amọ emaedʌk Yeruselem adinwana ye mbon Yebus, e-ekedʌññọ do. Mbon Yebus emaedọkkọ Defid ete, “Afo uduudʌkkọ umi, kpa mme nnan ye mme mbʌñọ ekeme adubịne fiin nsio.” Ammọ emaekere ebo, “Defid idiikanna idʌk idi mmi.” <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Kpayeado, Defid amaadʌk abọ akpọsọñ itie ke Saiyọn, a-adooho Abio Defid.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Ke usen ado Defid akebo, “Awo ndomokeed a-adiikan mbon Yebus anie adito adu usʌñ mmọọñ ñkesịme mme ‘mbʌñọ ye nnan’ e-edooho mme asua Defid.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido mbon ake Defid asuaha</char></note>” Ado anam ammọ ebo, “Mme ‘nnan ye mbʌñọ’ idiidʌkkọ akwere adidem.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Defid ndin amaadat akpọsọñ itie Saiyọn anam itieidʌñ amọ anyʌñ akoot anye Abio Defid. Anye amaabọp ndibene akanna anye akʌk, tọọñọ ke unaisọñ abod tutu adʌk esịd. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Ndin Defid amaanenekke akop uko, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan amaaba ye anye.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Akema Hiram adidem Tai amaadọñ ikpọ isʌñutom anọ Defid, esaña ye mme mboi eto sida, mme akọñeto ye mme abọbufọk itiad, ndin ammọ emaebọp akwere enọ Defid. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ke ntoro, Defid amaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaisio imọ anịm nte adidem andikara Isrel anyʌñ adịppe itie ubọọñ imọ ke anyọñ ke ntak ikọd amọ Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Defid amaanie uwak ibaan esa ye ataa ibaan ndọ ke Yeruselem, ke anye amaakekpọñ Hibrọn, ndin anye amaabon uwak nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfen do. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Mme anyịñ nditọ se ekeman enọ anye ke Yeruselem edoñño ami: Samua, Sobab, Natan, Sọlọmọn, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibha, Elisua, Nefek, Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elisama, Eliada ye Elifeled.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Akan Mbon Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Ke ini mbon Filistia emaekekop ke emaeyet Defid adan nte adidem ke afịd Isrel, ammọ emaedọọk ekaa ke afịd adudu adikiyem anye, ado Defid amaakop abaña, anye amaasọiyọ adʌk ke akpọsọñ itie. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Akem mbon Filistia emaedi editara eyọhọ Abedeñ Refaim; <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ke ntoro Defid amaabịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> “Nte ñka ñkenwana ye mbon Filistia? Afo ayaayaak ammọ ansịn miin ke ubọk?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Kaa, sia ke akpanikọ ami ñyaayaak mbon Filistia usịn fiin ke ubọk.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Ndin Defid amaakaa ke Baal Perasịm,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal Perasịm awuọñọ abọọñ a-atarake atara.</char></note> do ke anye akekan ammọ. Anye amaabo, “Naña mmọọñ abomo awuọñọ, ukem ado ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aboom mme asua mmi ke iso mmi.” Ntak ado anam, ekedikoot itie ado Baal Perasịm. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Mbon Filistia emaefeeñe ekpọñ mme abasi ubọk awo ammọ, ndin Defid ye ikọd amọ emaekoono ammọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ini keed mfen, mbon Filistia emaemaana edi, editara eyọhọ Abedeñ Refaim; <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />ke ntoro Defid amaabịp <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Kuusaña nnen-nnen ukaa, saña to edem kanna ammọ kʌk, nyʌñ nwana ye ammọ ke iso mme eto pọpla. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Emaesʌk ekokop uyom ntịm ñkpad isañ ke mme anyọñ eto pọpla, saña dʌk usọp-usọp sia ado adiiwọt ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibem iso awuọ akaa adikiwoot mbon ekọñ Filistia.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Ndin Defid amaanam naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ anye uyio, anye amaanyʌñ awoot mbon Filistia tọọñọ ke Kibiọn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin se ñko 1 Krọnikịd 14:16; ke Hibru ado Keba</char></note> akewuọ Kesa.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Eben Akebe Edioomo edi Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Defid amaamaana akoot afịd ñkparawa ke Isrel se ikop adudu, awo tọsịn edịb mme duob (30,000). <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Defid ye afịd ideen amọ emaekaa Baala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho Kiriad Yearim (se ke 1 Kr 13:6) </char></note> ke Yuda adikiben akebe edioomo Abasi nsio, e-ekoodo ke Anyịñ ado<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru, Septuakin ye Fulked inieghe Anyịñ ado.</char></note>, anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, e-edotto ke ufọọd mme serubim a-adoroke ke akebe edioomo. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Ammọ emaedot akebe edioomo Abasi ke ufa ukpadñkpọ enyʌñ esio anye ke ufọk Abinadab, a-akedoroke ke abod. Nditọ Abinadab, Usa ye Ahio ekekpeme ufa ukpadñkpọ <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />ake akebe edioomo Abasi akedoroke, ndin Ahio, ayịn Abinadab, akesaña ke iso akebe ado. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Defid ye afịd nditọ Isrel ekesʌk enam idaara ke afịd ukeme ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ekama uwak ñkpọ mbre nte mme ñkporo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke 1 Kr 13:8</char></note>, mme ekpa, mme ndidoudʌk, mme ibịdubọk, mme nsak ye mme simbal.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Ke ini ammọ emaekediwuọ itie ukọkñkpọ Nakọn, Usa amaasio ubọk akemʌm akebe edioomo Abasi, sia enañ amaafiọnnọ. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịppe ata Usa ato ke ntak edu unamñkpọ amọ; ndin Abasi amaamia anye anịm do ke isọñ, anye anyʌñ akpa do ke mben akebe edioomo Abasi.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Ndin Defid amaayat esịd sia ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịmme akeene Usa, ndin tutu mfịn ami ekoot itie ado Peres Usa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peres Usa awuọñọ adisakka ñkeene Usa.</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Defid amaakop ndịk abaña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> usen ado anyʌñ abo ate, “Akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiinam die idi ukañ mmi?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Anye ikinyịmmeke adiben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nọ adiba ye anye ke Abio Defid. Utu ke ado, anye amaaben akenịm ke ufọk Obed-Edom awo Kad. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeba afiọñ ita ke ufọk Obed-Edom, awo Kad, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiọñ anye mme afịd ubon amọ.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Ndin emaedọkkọ Adidem Defid ete, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiọñ afịd ufọk Obed-Edom ye afịd ñkpọ se anye anie, ke ntak akebe edioomo Abasi.” Ke ntoro Defid amaakaa adikiben akebe edioomo Abasi nsio ke ufọk Obed-Edom ndi ke Abio Defid ye idaara. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Akedo mbon se ikibiom akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> emaesaña ikpadisañ itiokeed, anye awa ayaara enañ keed ye ukọkʌk ñyịn enañ keed. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Defid akesịne nduọ-nduọ afọñ aboditọñ linen anyʌñ anek unek ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye afịd adudu amọ, <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />ke ini Defid ye afịd Isrel ekebenne akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ñkpo idaara ye uyom adukpoñ.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Idaha akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesʌkkọ adʌk Abio Defid, Maikal ayịn awonwaan Sọọl amaada ke ubenafịm ase. Ke anye amaakekịt Adidem Defid naña ataam anyʌñ anek unek ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaase anye ke ndek ke esịd amọ.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Ammọ emaeben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ enịm anye ke esịd atayad ake Defid akewuuhọ anịm anọ anye, ndin Defid amaawa mme ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Ke Defid amaakema ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana, anye amaadiọñ mbon awo ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Ndin anye amaadeeme nsio-nsio utọ uyo anọ afịd mbon Isrel, ibaan ye ideen. Akema afịd awo emaenyọñọ ufọk ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Ke ini Defid amaaketịmme anyọñ ufọk nọ akediọñ ikọd ufọk amọ, Maikal ayịn awonwaan Sọọl amaawuọ adisoobo anye anyʌñ abo, “Se naña adidem Isrel akpono idem amọ etob mfịn, ayak etək akpesaña ifed ke iso afịd ifʌn ibaan nditọufọk amọ, nte ndisịme awo idʌñ akpenam!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Ndin Defid amaabọọrọ Maikal ate, “Akedo ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akemmekke miin utu ke ete mfo me awo mfen ke ubon amọ, ke ini anye akensioho miin nte adaukara nnọọ ikọd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Isrel, ami ñyaanam idaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Ami ñyaanana ukpono ñkan ado, ndin ami ñyaasuenne idem ke anyen mmi. Ado ke abaña mme ifʌn ibaan afo atañña abaña mi, ami ñyaanie ukpono nto ammọ.”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Do ndin Maikal ayịn awonwaan Sọọl ikinieghe nditọ tutu usen anye akekpaaha.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Enwọñọ Abasi Anwọñọke Anọ Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Ke adidem amaaketuakka atie ke akwere amọ, ndin ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakenọ anye emem ke atu mme asua e-ekekannake anye ekʌk, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />adidem amaadọkkọ prọfed Natan ate, “Se miin mi, naña ndʌñ ke ufọk sida, ke ini akebe edioomo Abasi asịneke ke atayad.”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Natan amaabọọrọ adidem ate, “Se idodo usịneke fiin ke akikere, nam ado, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ye afo.”<verse eid="2SA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Ado ke akonayio ado, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Natan, ate:<verse eid="2SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Kaa kedọkkọ awo mmi Defid bo, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: Nte afo ado awo se idiibọp ufọk innọ miin yak ndʌñ ke esịd? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Ami ndʌññọ ke ufọk tọọñọ ke usen ami ñkebenne nditọ Isrel nsio ke isọñ Iyib tutu usen mfịn. Ado ami ñkesaña ke itie mme itie ye atayad nte itie idʌñ. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ke afịd usʌñisañ mmi ye nditọ Isrel, akenam ami mmaadọkkọ keed ke atu mme andikara ammọ ami ñkenọọhọ mbo ebọọk ikọd mmi Isrel nte, “Nsoo ido ke ndufo ekama sida ebọp ufọk ennọ miin?” ’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Idahami ndin, dọkkọ isʌñutom mmi Defid, ‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: Ami ñkuben fiin ñkpọñ itie ubọọk ufene, uben nsio ke ukpeme ufene, ñnyʌñ umek fiin andikara ikọd mmi Isrel. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Ami mmeba ye afo ke itie nte afo akaaka, ndin mmediañña afịd mme asua mfo mfep ke iso mfo. Idahami ami ñyaanam anyịñ mfo akpon, aba nte anyịñ mme ñkpọsọñ awo ke ederimbod. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Ami ñyaanịm itie nnọ ikọd mmi Isrel ñnyʌñ nsọọñọ ammọ nnịm nọ ammọ enie itieidʌñ ammọ, mbaak awo adifịna ammọ aba. Mbon ibak idiifiighe ammọ aba, nte naña ammọ ekenam ke aditọọñọ <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />nte e-enyʌññọ enam tọọñọ ke ini ami ñkemekke mme adaaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mme abiideikpe</char></note> nnọ ikọd mmi Isrel. Ami ñyaanyʌñ unọ fiin nduọkadudu nto ubọk mme asua mfo.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> usian fiin abo ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke idem amọ adiibọp ufọk unọ fiin: <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Mme usen uwem mfo ke isọñ emaekweeñe nọ afo akeduọk adudu ye mme eteete mfo, ami ñyaabenne nditọ mfo ndot ke itie ubọọñ mfo, adiido abʌk ye iyiib mfo, ñyaanyʌñ nnam ubọọñ amọ asọọñọ ada. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Anye ado awo a-adiibọp ufọk inọ Anyịñ mmi, ndin ami ñyaanam ebekpo ubọọñ amọ ada ke nsi-nsi. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Ami ñyaado ete amọ, anye ayaanyʌñ ado ayịn mmi. Anye amaanam ndudue, ami ñyaatʌnọ anye ke ikpa a-awo abọppọ, ke umia ake ubọk awo. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Ado tutu amama awo idiibọọhọ anye ima mmi, nte naña ami ñkeben nsio ñkpọñ ye Sọọl, ake ami ñkedooroke nsio ke iso mfo. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Ufọk mfo ye abioubọọñ mfo eyaesọọñọ eda ke iso mmi ke nsi-nsi; ebekpo mfo ayaada ke nsi-nsi.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Natan amaakedọkkọ Defid afịd mme ikọ ñkukịd ami.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akam Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Ndin adidem Defid amaadʌk aketie ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anyʌñ abo ate:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="2SA 7:18">“Ami ndo anie awo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, ubon mmi ado nsoo, nọ afo andịppe miin awuọ utọ ekamba itie ami? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Ndin aba nte ami isʌkkọ ikekem ke anyen mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, afo amaana atañ ikọ abaña ini iso ufọk isʌñutom mfo, ndin ewʌhọ ami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, anọ ñkaña awo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ado anọ ubon awo</char></note> nte ami!<verse eid="2SA 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />“Nsoo ñkpọ mfen ke Defid akeme aditañ ye afo? Sia afo amediọọñọ awo mfo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Ke ntak ikọ mfo ye ke uduak mfo, afo amenam utọ ekamba ñkpọ ami, anyʌñ anam awo mfo adiọọñọ abaña.<verse eid="2SA 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />“Afo amenekke akpon, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara! Ibaaha anditie nte afo, inyʌññọ iba Abasi mfen kpa afo ikpọọñ, nte naña ñnyịn ikop ke utọñ ñnyịn. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Ndin mme anie iba nte ikọd mfo Isrel, idịd keed ke iso isọñ ake Abasi akekaaha akefak asio anọ idem amọ, anyʌñ anịm anyịñ anọ idem amọ, anyʌñ anam ñkpoon ye mme ñyọọ-ñyọọ utịppeñkpọ ke adibịne mme idịd ye mme abasi ammọ nsịññe ke iso ikọd mfo, ake afo akefakka asio ke isọñ Iyib?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se Septuakin ye 1 Kr 17:21.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Afo amaanam ikọd mfo Isrel edo asaña-asaña ake mfo ke nsi-nsi, afo ñko, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, amaanyʌñ akappa ado Abasi ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Ndin idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi, kpono enwọñọ a-afo anamma abaña awo mfo ye ufọk amọ. Nam naña afo akenwọñọ, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />ma anyịñ mfo akpon ke nsi-nsi. Ndin mme awo eyaebo ete, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado Abasi ke afịd Isrel!’ Ñko ufọk awo mfo Defid ayaasọọñọ ada ke iso mfo.<verse eid="2SA 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, Abasi Isrel, afo ameyaara ñkpọ ami anọ afʌnadeen mfo ate, ‘Ami ñyaabọp ufọk unọ fiin.’ Ke ntoro awo mfo anie uko adibọñ akam ami unọọ fiin. <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, afo ado Abasi! Enwọñọ mfo ado akpanikọ, afo amenyʌñ anwọñọ mme nti ñkpọ ami anọ awo mfo. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Ndin yak unem fiin esịd idahami adidiọñ ubon isʌñutom mfo, nọ anye akaiso aba ke iso mfo ke nsi-nsi; sia afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, ametañ ikọ, ndin ye adidiọñ mfo eyaediọñ ufọk isʌñutom mfo ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Edikan ake Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Nte ini akaaha iso, Defid amaakan mbon Filistia amaanyʌñ anam ammọ esịne ke ukara amọ, amaanyʌñ abọ Metek Amma asio ke ukara mbon Filistia.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Defid amaanyʌñ akan mbon Mọb. Anye amaanam ammọ enaa ke isọñ, ndin adat udʌk adomo ammọ. Anye amaawot kwa udịm awo ammọ iba, ndin kwa ayọhọ udịm ita anye anịm uwem. Ke ntoro mbon Mọb emaesuuk iwuod enọ Defid enyʌñ ekpe isob enọ anye.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Ke akanna ado, Defid amaakan Hadadesa ayịn Rehob, adidem Soba ke ini anye akekaaha adikimaana nsọọñọ ukara amọ ke inyañ Yufretis. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Defid amaamʌm sariọd amọ tọsịn keed (1,000), anyʌñ amʌm mbon uwad sariọd tọsịn itiaba (7,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin se ñko mme Ikpaikpa Akpainyañ ye 1 Kr 18:4; Ke ikpañwed Masoretik ewet emʌm 1,700 mbon uwad sariọd</char></note> ye mbon ekọñ e-esañake ke ukod awo tọsịn edịb (20,000). Anye amaakpok mme sariọd ado akpan asịb ado ayaak enañ sariọd ikie abono.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Ke ini mbon Aram ke Damaskọs ekedieghe edinwam Hadadesa adidem Soba, Defid amaawot awo ammọ tọsịn edịb mme iba (22,000). <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Anye amaanịm itie mbonekọñ ke idʌñ ubọọñ Aram ke Damaskọs, ndin mme mbon Aram ekeba ke idak ukara amọ enyʌñ ekpe isob. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Defid edikan ke itie akeedodo anye akekaaha.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Defid amaakoono mme atuekọñ kold a-akenieghe mme adaaha ekọñ Hadadesa adi Yeruselem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Adidem Defid amaakoono uwak ibad brọns ato Teba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin se ñko 1 Kr 18:8; Ke Hibru ado Beta.</char></note> ye Berotai, e-ekedooho mme abio Hadadesa akenieghe.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Ke ini Tou<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke Hibru Toi, asʌkkọ kpa Tou; se ñko ke 2 Sa 8:10</char></note> adidem Hamad akekoppo ke Defid amaakan afịd udịmekọñ Hadadesa, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />anye amaadọñ ayịn amọ Yoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoram ado ukem ye Hadoram</char></note> abịne adidem Defid, ate akekọọm anyʌñ adaara ye anye ke adikikan Hadadesa ke iso ekọñ, sia Hadadesa amaasiba ke ekọñ ye Tou. Yoram amaaben mme ñkpọ enọ ake silfa, kold ye brọns asọk Defid.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Adidem Defid amaakoono mme ñkpọ ami anịm asaña-asaña anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ukem naña anye akenam ye mme silfa mme kold e-eketooho mme idịd se anye akekan: <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Edọm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Hibru, Septuakin ye Siriak (se ñko 1 Kr 18:11); ataa uwak ikpañwed Hibru ado Aram</char></note> ye Mọb, mbon Amọn ye Filistia, mbon Amalek. Anye amaanyʌñ anịm asaña-asaña mbịme se anye akebọi Hadadesa ayịn Rehob, adidem Soba, anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Ndin Defid amaanekke awuọ etob ke anye amaakenyọñ adisobo mbon Edọm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etək ubaak ikpañwed ake Hibru, Septuakin ye Siriak (se ñko 1 Kr 18:12); ataa uwak ikpañwed Hibru ado Aram (a-adooho mbon Aram)</char></note> tọsịn duob mme itiaita (18,000) ke Abedeñ Inʌñ.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Anye amaanịm mme itie mbonekọñ ke afịd Edọm, ndin ataa afịd mbon Edọm emaekappa eba ke idak ukara Defid. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Defid edikan ke afịd itie nte anye akekaaka.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ikpọ Mbon Utom Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Defid amaakara ke afịd Isrel, anyʌñ anam nti ye ndinen ñkpọ anọ afịd mme ikọd amọ. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoab ayịn Seruya akedo adaiwuod ekọñ, Yehosafad ayịn Ahilud akedo anamibad; <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadọk ayịn Ahitub ye Ahimelek ayịn Abiata ekedoñño mme aku, Seraiya akedo awedñwed; <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada akekara mbon Kered ye mbon Peled; ndin mme nditọ ideen Defid ekedoñño mme aku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ekedo mme ñkpoon adaaha (se Septuakin ye Taakum; se ñko 1 Kr 18:17)</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Defid ye Mefibosed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Akem Defid amaabịp ate, “Nte aba awo ndomokeed se isʌhọ ke ufọk Sọọl ake ami ñkpewọttọ mfọn ke ntak Yọnatan?”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Amaaba ayịnufọk ke ubon Sọọl e-ekekoodo Siba. Emaedọñ ekoot anye adi ke iso Defid, ndin adidem amaabo anye ate, “Afo ado Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Anye amaabọọrọ abo, “Ami ndo ayịnedọñ utom mfo.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Adidem amaabịp ate, “Isʌkkọ iba awo ndomokeed a-abaaha ke uwem a-atooho ufọk Sọọl a-ami ñkemeke adiwọt mfọn Abasi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba amaabọọrọ adidem abo, “Asʌk ababa ayịn Yọnatan, anye ado mbʌñọ ke naña ukod iba.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Adidem amaabịp abo, “Anye aba ke mmọọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siba amaabọọrọ ate, “Anye aba ke ufọk Makia ayịn Amiel ke Lo Deba.”<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ndin adidem Defid amaanam yak ekeben anye ke Lo Deba edi, ke ufọk Makia ayịn Amiel.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ke ini Mefibosed ayịn Yọnatan, ayịn Sọọl, amaakedi ke iso Defid, anye amaanyuuk iwuod akpono anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Defid amaabo, “Mefibosed!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami nda ke ndaha utom mfo.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Defid amaabo anye ate, “Kuuyak idem unyeñ, sia ke akpanikọ, ami ñyauwọt fiin mfọn ke ntak ete mfo Yọnatan. Ami ñyaamaana ñkappa afịd isọñ se ikinie etebom mfo Sọọl unọ fiin, afo ñko uduudia ndidia afịd ini ke akpokoro mmi.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosed amaanyuuk iwuod anyʌñ abo, “Ayịnufọk mfo ado anie, a-anamma nọ afo akanna iso ase adukpo ewa nte ami?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ndin adidem amaadọñ ekoot Siba, ayịnufọk Sọọl, anyʌñ abo anye, “Ami mmenọ ayeyịn eteufọk mfo afịd ñkpọ se ikinie Sọọl ye ubon amọ. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Afo ye nditọ mfo ideen ye nditọufọk mfo ana etọ inwañ enọ anye, enyʌñ ekoono mbunwịm esọk anye, nọ ayeyịn eteufọk mfo anie se adia. Ñko Mefibosed, ayeyịn eteufọk mfo, adiidia ndidia ke akpokoro mmi afịd ini.” (Siba akenie nditọ ideen duob mme ition ye nditọufọk edịb).<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Akem Siba amaabo adidem ate, “Ayịnufọk mfo ayaanam se adodo abọọñ ye adidem mmi anọọhọ ayịnufọk amọ uyio abo anam.” Ndin Mefibosed amaadia ñkpọ ke akpokoro Defid<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin; ke Hibru ado mmi</char></note> ukem nte keed ke atu nditọ adidem.<verse eid="2SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosed amaanie etəkayịn awodeen keed e-ekekoodo Mika, ñko afịd mbon ufọk Siba ekedo nditọufọk Mefibosed. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Ndin Mefibosed akedʌñ ke Yeruselem, sia anye akesidia ndidia afịd ini ke akpokoro adidem; anye akedo mbʌñọ.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Defid Akan Mbon Amọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Nte ñkpọ akaaha iso, adidem mbon Amọn amaakpa, ndin ayịn amọ Hanun amaadat itie amọ nte adidem. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Defid amaakere ke esịd amọ ate, “Ami ñyaafọn ido ye Hanun ayịn Nahas, kpa naña ete amọ akefọn ido ye ami.” Ndin Defid amaadọñ mme isʌñutom ekedọñ Hanun esịd ke ntak ñkpa ete amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Ke mme isʌñutom Defid emaekewuọ ke isọñ mbon Amọn, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />mme adaiso mbon ekọñ Amọn emaebo Hanun abọọñ ammọ ete, “Afo akere abo ke Defid akpono ete mfo ke anye adidọñ mme ikpọ isʌñutom inọọ usọk abo edudọñ esịd? Ñkọ idooho Defid anam ñkara adidọñ ammọ unọ fiin nọ ediyep abio enyʌñ eduuñọ naña etọ anye ekat?” <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ke ntoro Hanun amaamuum mme ikpọ isʌñutom Defid, akwaat mbakka iba ñwaebek kwa awo, afat afọñidem ammọ ke itie efʌd aduọọñọ, ndin abịn ammọ ate enyọñọ.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Ke emaekedọkkọ Defid ñkpọ ami, anye amaadọñ isʌñutom ekesoobo ammọ, sia emaenekke esuenne ammọ. Adidem amaanọ uyio ate, “Ndufo iba ke Yeriko tutu ñwaebek ndufo amaana atịppe, mbemiso ndufo enyọñọ edi.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Ke ini mbon Amọn ekekịtte ebo ke mmimọ imiyat Defid esịd, ammọ emaekekpe mbonekọñ usaña ke ikpad mbon Aram awo tọsịn edịb (20,000) eto Bed Rehob ye Aram Soba, ye adidem Maaka ye ideen tọsịn keed (1,000), ye mbon Tob awo tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000) ke Tob.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Defid akekop ami, anye amaasio Yoab ye afịd udịm mbon unwana ekọñ. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Mbon Amọn emaewuọñọ edibeeñe idem enyʌñ eda ke udịm unwana ekọñ ke inuaatob abio ammọ, ke ini mbon Aram Soba ye Rehob ye ikọd Tob ye Maaka ekebaaha ke idem ammọ ke anwa esịd idịd.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoab amaakịt ke mme udịmekọñ mmọdo eba ke iso ye ke edem amọ, anye ndin amaasat ubaak mme nta anwanaekọñ ke Isrel anyʌñ asio ammọ adọñ eka ekenwana ye mbon Aram. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Anye amaasịn ubaak mbon ekọñ se ikisʌhọ ke idak ndadusʌñ Abisai ayịneka amọ awodeen, ndin emaedọñ ammọ eka ekenwana ye mbon Amọn. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoab amaabo ate, “Adieke mbon Aram esọññọ adudu eñkan miin, ndin ana ndufo ediñnyaaña miin; ado mbon Amọn ekpesọñ adudu ikan ndufo, ndin ami ñyaadi ndinyaaña ndufo. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Ikop uko, yak ñnyịn inyʌñ inwana uko-uko inọ ikọd ñnyịn ye mme abio ake Abasi ñnyịn. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanam se ifọn anye ke anyen.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ndin Yoab ye udịmekọñ e-ekesañake ye anye emaewuọñọ ekaa edinwana ye mbon Aram, ndin mbon Aram emaefeeñe ke iso amọ. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ke ini mbon Amọn ekekịtte ebo ke mbon Aram ekesʌk efeeñe, ammọ emaefeeñe ke iso Abisai enyʌñ edọñọ esịd abio. Ndin Yoab amaanyọñ akpọñ adinwana ye mbon Amọn anyʌñ adi Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Ke ini mbon Aram emaekekịt ke Isrel ikan mmimọ, ammọ emaemaana eboho itie keed. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadesa amaanam nọ ekoono mbon Aram ekaaña edem Akpa Yufretis edi; ammọ emaedika Helam, esaña ye Sobak adaiso mbon ekọñ Hadadesa akedat ammọ usʌñ.<verse eid="2SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Ke emaekedọkkọ Defid ibaña ñkpọ ami, anye amaakoot afịd Isrel abok, ndin amaanyʌñ akaaña Yọdan akewuọ Helam. Mbon Aram emaetịm udịmekọñ ammọ adikisoobo ye Defid ñnyʌñ ñnwana ye anye. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Ado mbon Aram emaefeeñe ke iso Isrel, ndin Defid amaawot mbon ake ekewatta sariọd ekọñ ammọ tọsịn itiaba (7,000) ye mbon ekọñ ake ekesañake ke ukod ammọ tọsịn aba (40,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin (se ñko 1 Kr 19:18); Ke Hibru mbon uwadenañ mbakara</char></note>. Anye amaanyʌñ awot Sobak, adaiso mbon ekọñ ammọ, ndin anye amaakpa ke ndo. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Ke afịd ndidem e-ekebaaha ke idak Hadadesa emaekekịt naña Isrel ekan ammọ ke ekọñ, ammọ emaenam emem ye nditọ Isrel enyʌñ ekappa eba ke idak ukara Isrel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Ke ntak ado ndịk ikiyakka mbon Aram enwam mbon Amọn aba ke ekọñ.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Defid ye Bedseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Ke ntọọñọ isua amaakebakka, ke ini ndidem esiwuọñọke eka ekọñ, Defid amaasio Yoab ye mme ideen adidem ye afịd mbonekọñ Isrel adọñ ekọñ. Ammọ emaesobo mbon Amọn enyʌñ ekanna Raba ekʌk. Ado Defid akeba ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Ndubiayio usen keed Defid amaadakka ada akpọñ ikʌk amọ anyʌñ asaña akanna anyọñ akwere adidem. Anye amaada ke anyọñ akọmufọk amọ akịt nte awonwaan ayie idem. Awonwaan ado amaayaiya eti-eti; <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />ndin Defid amaadọñ awo akebịp abaña anye. Isʌñutom amaadọkkọ Defid abo, “Anye akere Bedseba, ayịn Eliam, anwaan ndọ Yuria awo Hed.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Akem Defid amaadọñ mme isʌñutom nọ ekeben anye edi. Anye amaadi abịne Defid, ndin Defid amaanaa ye anye. (Idaha ado anye akenam idem amọ asana ato ke ntak ndek itieisọñ amọ). Akem anye amaanyọñ ufọk. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Ndin awonwaan ado amaayommo anyʌñ adọñ utom anọ Defid abo ate, “Ami mmeyommo.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ndin Defid amaadọñ etob ami anọ Yoab: “Nọ Yuria awo Hed yak ensọk.” Ndin Yoab amaanọ anye asọk Defid. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Yuria amaakedisoobo ye anye, Defid amaabịp naña ñkpọ akeba ye Yoab, naña ñkpọ aba ye mbonekọñ ye naña ekọñ aka iso. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Akem Defid amaabo Yuria, “Nyọñ kaa ufọk mfo ke yie ikpad.” Ndin Yuria amaakpọñ akwere adidem, ñko adidem amaanọ enọ yak edat esọk anye. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Ado Yuria akena ke inuaatob akwere adidem adaiya ye afịd mme nditọufọk eteufọk amọ, anye ikinyʌññọ ika ufọk amọ.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Emaedọkkọ Defid ete, “Yuria ikinyọññọ ufọk.” Ndin anye amaabịp Yuria ate, “Ñkọ afo asʌk anyọñ iso ekọñ adi? Nsoo ikido yak afo umuukunyọññọ ufọk?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Yuria amaabo Defid ate, “Akebe edioomo, Isrel ye Yuda mmọdo ebañña ke mme atayad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido eba ke Sukọd</char></note>, ñko adaiso mmi Yoab ye ikọd abọọñ mmi enam nnaaekọñ ke anwa abio. Ami ndiinam die ñkan ñka ufọk mmi ñkedia, ñnwọñ ñnyʌñ nnam ima ye anwaan mmi? Adaña nte afo aduuho uwem, ami ndiinamma utọ ñkpọ ado!”<verse eid="2SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Ndin Defid amaabo anye ate, “Ba mi usen keed mfen, ndin ami ñyausio unyọñ ñkpọñ.” Ndin, Yuria amaaba ke Yeruselem usen ado ye edem usen. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Ke ikood Defid, anye amaadia ndidia anyʌñ anwọñ ñkpọ ye Defid, ñko Defid amaanam ukọd anaam Yuria. Ado ke ndubiayio, Yuria amaawuọ akena ke aya amọ adaiya ke atu mme nditọufọk eteufọk amọ; anye ikinyọññọ ufọk.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Defid amaawet ñwedetob ke ubakusen anọ Yuria aben asọk Yoab. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Se anye akewet ado ami, “Nọ Yuria aka iso ekọñ a-anekkeke asọñ ubọk. Amaanam, tịmme edem kpọñ anye nọ eyʌppọ anye nọ akpa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Ndin ke ini Yoab anwanake ekọñ ke esịd abio, anye amaasịn Yuria ke itie a-anye akediọọñọke abo ke mbonekọñ e-esọññọ ubọk anwan emaebañña. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Ke ini mbon abio ado emaekewuọñọ edinwana ye Yoab, emaewot usʌk mbonekọñ Defid, ke akanna ado, Yuria awo Hed amaakpa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Yoab amaanọ afịd mbʌk ñkpọ se ikitịppe ke iso ekọñ esọk Defid. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Anye amaatemme isʌñutom abo ate: “Ke ini afo amaanọ adidem mbʌk ekọñ ami ama, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />adidem akeme ibịmme iyadesịd, ndin anye akpubịp fiin abo, ‘Nsoo ido nọ ndufo ekedʌk ekpere esịd abio ekenwana ekọñ? Ndufo ikidiọọñọke ke ammọ eyaeda ke anyọñ ndibene etop mme idañ? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Anie akewot Abimelek ayịn Yerub-Besed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esʌkkọ ediọọñọ nte Yerub-Baal (a-adooho Kidiọn)</char></note>? Idooho awonwaan akeda ke anyọñ ndibene atop eka itiad atọ anye ke iwuod, yak anye akpa ke Tebes? Nsoo ido yak ndufo ekesaña ekpere ndibene ntoro?’ Anye akpubịp ntoro, afo ñko dọkkọ anye bo, ‘Akanna ado, ayịnufọk mfo Yuria awo Hed akpa.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Isʌñutom amaadakka isañ, anye amaadọkkọ Defid afịd ñkpọ se Yoab akebo anye aketañ, anye amaakesịm. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Isʌñutom amaadọkkọ Defid ate, “Mbon ekọñ emaikan ñnyịn ubọk enyʌñ ewuọñọ ibịne ñnyịn ke anwa, ado ñnyịn imaibịne ammọ isio ikiwuọ inuaatob abio. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Akenam, mbon utop utịgha emaeda ke anyọñ ndibene etop idañ etọ ikọd mfo, ndin usʌk ikọd adidem emaekpañña. Akanna ado, ayịnufọk mfo Yuria, awo Hed akpa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Defid amaadọñ isʌñutom abo ate, “Dọkkọ Yoab bo, ‘Kuuyak ami ufịna fiin; akañkañ awot anye ami anyʌñ awot anye ako. Sọñ ubọk nwana dʌk esịd abio nyʌñ sobo anye.’ Tañ ntom nọ asọọñọ Yoab esịd.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Anwaan Yuria akekop ke ebe amọ akpa, anye amaafʌhọ anye. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ini mfʌhọ akekweeñe, Defid amaanam eben Bedseba edi ufọk amọ, ndin anye amaakappa ado anwaan amọ anyʌñ aman ayịn anọ anye. Ado ñkpọ se Defid akenam amaayat <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> esịd.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan Asua Anọ Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ Natan utom anọ Defid. Natan amaakekaa ikikịt Defid, amaabo anye ate, “Mme awo iba ekeba ke abio keed, keed anie ñkpọ, keed ado uweene. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Imọ awo ado amaanie uwak ibad edọñ ye enañ, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />ado awo uweene ami ikinieghe ñkpọ ndomokeed ikan etək ñkpʌk umanedọñ a-anye akedeppe. Anye amaabọọk edọñ ado, anye akọt akpon ye anye mme nditọ amọ. Edọñ ado amaawana ndidia ye anye, anwọñ mmọọñ ke kọọb keed, anyʌñ asidaiya ke ikpanesịd amọ. Akeba nte ayịn awonwaan anọ anye.<verse eid="2SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />“Usen keed asenawo amaadi ufọk imọ awo, ado anye amaatre adidat keed ke atu mme edọñ me mme enañ ake amọ nọ enam ndidia enọ asenawo ado a-akediighe abịne anye. Utu ke ado, anye amaadat etək ñkpʌk umanedọñ ake uweene awo ado anyʌñ akama atem ñkpọ anọ awo a-akediighe adise anye.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Defid amaabịmme iyadesịd abaña awo ado anyʌñ abo Natan ate, “Ma uwem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, awo a-akenamma ñkpọ ami ana akpa! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Anye ana akpe akʌk edọñ ado akañ inaañ, sia anye akenamma utọ ñkpọ ado, inyʌññọ inie mbọm.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Ndin Natan amaabo Defid ate, “Afo ado awo ado! Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, atañ: ‘Ami ñkuyet fiin adan nnịm nte adidem ke Isrel, ami ñko mmaufak fiin nsio ke ubọk Sọọl. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Ami mmaunọ fiin ufọk eteufọk mfo, ñnyʌñ ñyaak ibaan ndọ eteufọk mfo usịn fiin ke ubọk. Ami mmaunọ fiin afịd Isrel ye Yuda. Ñko akpedo afịd ami amaasịp abọhọ, ami ñkpekesʌk unọọnọ fiin ñkan ado. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Ntak afo akesịnne uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ndek ke adinam se idiọọk ke anyen amọọ? Afo amaatọ Yuria awo Hed ke akañkañ awot anyʌñ adat anwaan ndọ amọ nọ akappa ado ake mfo. Afo akewot anye ke akañkañ ake mbon Amọn. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Ndin, idahami, akañkañ idiikpọññọ ubon mfo, sia amansịn miin ke ndek anyʌñ adat anwaan ndọ Yuria, awo Hed, nte anwaan mfo.’<verse eid="2SA 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: ‘Ami ñyaanam afanekọñ ato esịd ufọk mfo usịm fiin. Ke ataa iso mfo ami ñyaakoono ibaan ndọ mfo nnọ awo a-anekkeke ukpere fiin idem, ndin anye ayaanaa ye ibaan ndọ mfo ke ata ufọọd mba uweemeayio. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Afo akenam ke ndịbe, ado ami ndiinam ñkpọ ami ke ufọọd mba uweemeayio ke iso afịd Isrel.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Akema, Defid amaabo Natan ate, “Ami mmenam idiọọk ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Natan amaabọọrọ abo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaafeen idiọọkñkpọ mfo. Afo uduukpaaha. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Ado ke ntak ñkpọ a-afo anamma mi, amewọt <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekandịk emiom, ayịn a-amanake unọọ fiin ayaakpa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Ke Natan amaakenyọñ ufọk, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatuuk ayịn a-anwaan Yuria akemanna anọ Defid, ndin anye amaadọñọ. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Defid amaakpe Abasi ubọk ke iwuod ayịn ado. Anye amaatre udia anyʌñ asịne afọñ mfʌhọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikpañwed Ikpaikpa Akpainyañ ye Septuakin; ikpañwed Masoretik inieghe afọñ mfʌhọ.</char></note>, anaa ke isọñ. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Mme ñkpisọñ ke ubon amọ emaeda ke ñkañ amọ edidịppe anye ke isọñ, ado anye amaasịn, anye ikinyʌññọ ikeene ammọ idia ndidia.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Ayịn ado amaakpa ke ayọhọ usen itiaba. Mbon se ikikpeme Defid emaekop ndịk edidọkkọ anye mbo ke ayịn ado akpa, sia ammọ ekekere ebo, “Anye ikikpañña utọñ inọ ñnyịn naña ayịn ado akesʌkkọ aba ke uwem. Ñnyịn idiinam die idọkkọ anye idahami ke ayịn ami akpa? Anye akeme adinam idem amọ idiọọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Akem Defid akekịt abo ke nditọufọk eketañ ikọ ke adu ke atu ammọ, ndin anye amaadiọọñọ ke ayịn ado amaakpa. Ke ntoro, anye amaabịp abo, “Ayịn akpa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Ammọ emaebọọrọ ebo, “Ii, anye akpa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Do ndin, Defid amaadakka ada ke isọñ. Ke anye amaakeyie idem ama, afiọññọ adan, anyʌñ akpəho afọñ, anye amaadʌk esịd ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekpono anye. Akema, anye amaanyọñ akaa ufọk amọ, ndin amaabo yak inọ imọ ndidia, ndin anye amaadia.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Ado nditọufọk amọ emaebịp ebo, “Nsoo ido yak afo anam ñkpọ ntom? Idaha ayịn akebaaha ke uwem, afo amaatre ndidia anyʌñ atua ayịd, ado idaha ayịn akpaaha mi, afo adakka ada adia ndidia!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Anye amaabọọrọ abo, “Idaha ayịn akebaaha ke uwem, ami mmaatre ndidia ñnyʌñ ntua ayịd, ami ñkekere mbo, ‘Anie adiọọñọ? <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeme ifọn mfọn ye ami anyʌñ ayaak ayịn ado adu uwem.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Ado idaha anye amaakekpa mi, ufọn ami adika iso ntre ndidia-a? Nte ami mmekeme adimaana nnam anye atịmme adi? Ami ndiika mbịne anye, ado anye ikemeke aditịmme imbịne miin.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Akema Defid amaadọñ anwaan amọ Bedseba esịd, amaanyʌñ akaa akenam ima ye anye. Anye amaaman ayịn awodeen, ndin ammọ ekekoot anye Sọlọmọn. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaama anye, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />ñko sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akemaaha anye, amaanọ uyio ato prọfed Natan ate akoot anye Yedidia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yedidia awuọñọ anye ake Abọọñ amaaha.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ami amaakeboiyo, Yoab amaanwana ekọñ ye idʌñ Raba ake mbon Amọn anyʌñ abọ akpọsọñ abio adidem ado. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoab ndin amaadọñ isʌñutom anọ Defid, ate, “Ami mmenwana ye Raba ñnyʌñ mbọ efaak mmọọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Koono udịmekọñ mbon ñko di nwana nyʌñ dat abio ado. Imiidooho ntoro, ami ñyaadat abio ado nnie, ndin eyaekoot anye endian miin.”<verse eid="2SA 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ndin Defid amaatịm afịd mbonekọñ amọ aben akaa Raba, akenwana anyʌñ akan. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Defid amaayaara adidem ammọ anyanya ke iwuod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido ato ake Milkom (a-adooho ake Molek)</char></note>, ndin emaeben eyat anye ke iwuod. Anyanya akedoppo talen kold keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note>, ekenyʌñ edat mme nsọñudua itiad ebot anye. Defid amaakoono uwak ibad mbịme ato abio ado <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />anyʌñ asịññe mme awo se ikiba do, adinọ ammọ utom e-ekamake mme uyọọkñkpọ, ukịmisọñ ye ekịd enam, anye anyʌñ adọñ ammọ ke utom uboditiad. Defid amaanam ntom ke afịd mme abio Amọn. Ke akpatre, anye ye afịd mbonekọñ amọ emaenyọñọ ekaa Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Amnọn ye Tama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Ke uyọhọ ini, Amnọn ayịn Defid amaanie udọñ ima abaña Tama, uyaiya ayịneka awonwaan Absalọm, ayịn Defid.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Ñko ima ami ye ayịnete amọ Tama amaanekke afịna Amnọn tutu anam udọñọ amʌm anye. Ñko sia anye akedooho mboppo inyʌññọ idiọọñọ awodeen, usʌñ amaasọñ anye adikan nnam ñkpọ ima ye anye.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Amnọn amaanie anọitem a-akekereke Yọnadab, ayịn Simia, ayịneka Defid. Yọnadab akedo ataa awo ñkara. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Anye amaabịp Amnọn ate, “Ntak a-afo, ayịn adidem, abaaha ntaha-ntaha ntom ke usen ke usen-e? Ado nte ubooho undọkkọ se ido?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnọn amaadọkkọ anye abo, “Ami mmema Tama, ayịneka Absalọm, ayịnete mmi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yọnadab amaatemme anye ate, “Kaa ke suuk naa ke ikʌk nyʌñ nam nte idem usọññọ. Ke ini ete mfo amaadʌk idukịt, bo anye ate, ‘Ami ñkpaama ayịnete mmi Tama adi adinnọ ñkpọ yak ndia. Yak anye aditem ndidia ado ke iso mmi nọ ami nse anye, ndin ndia nto ubọk amọ.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ndin Amnọn amaasuuk anaa anyʌñ anam nte idem isọññọ anye. Ke ini adidem akedʌkkọ aka adise anye, Amnọn amaadọkkọ anye abo, “Ami ñkpaama ayịnete mmi Tama adi, adinam asaña-asaña uyo ke iso mmi, nọ ami nta nto ubọk amọ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Defid amaadọñ ekedọkkọ Tama ke akwere ebo, “Kaa ufọk ayịnete mfo, Amnọn, kenam ndidia nọ anye.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Ndin Tama amaakaa ufọk ayịnete amọ Amnọn, a-akenaaha ana. Anye amaakama ndomuyo, amaanuakka, anam uyo ke iso amọ, anyʌñ asañ uyo ado. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Ndin Tama amaakama usan usañ uyo asịn uyo ado anọ anye, ado anye amaasịn adidia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amnọn amaabo, “Nam afịd awo ewuọ ekpọñ itie ami.” Ndin afịd awo emaewuọñọ ekpọñ anye. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Akem Amnọn amaabo Tama ate, “Ben ndidia ado dʌk di esịd ubeed nnaa mmi nọ ami ndia nto ubọk mfo.” Tama amaanyʌñ aben uyo anye akenamma asọk ayịnete amọ Amnọn ke ubeed nnaa amọ. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Ado Tama akeben ndidia asọk anye abo adia, Amnọn amaamʌm anye anyʌñ abo ate, “Dʌk di naa ye ami ke ikʌk, ayịnete mmi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tama amaabo ate, “Iyoo, ayịnete mmi! Kuñnyịk miin! Inaaha enam utọ ñkpọ ami ke Isrel! Kuunam utọ ibak ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Afo amekere ambaña miin? Ami ndiiben utọ abuud ami ñka uke? Afo ñko ukereke ubaña idem mfo? Afo akpeba nte keed ke atu idiọọk ntʌn ke Isrel. Mbọk, dọkkọ adidem, anye idiikpanna ami adudọ fiin.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Ado anye amaasịn adikpañ utọñ nnọọ anye, ñko sia anye amaasọñ adudu akan anye, Amnọn amaanaa anye ke ñkanubọk.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ami akeboiyo, Amnọn amaasua Tama ye ataa akpọsọñ usua. Ke akpanikọ anye amaasua anye akan naña akema anye. Amnọn amaabo anye ate, “Dakka da nyʌñ saña wuọ!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tama amaabo ate, “Iyoo, afo adimbịne miin nsio ayaadiọọk akan se afo akap ananam ye ami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Ado Amnọn ikikpañña utọñ inọ anye. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Ndin anye amaakoot ataa ayịnufọk amọ keed anyʌñ abo anye, “Nam ayịn awonwaan ami akpọñ iso mmi, nyʌñ sịn etịñ udọk baha anye.” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Ndin, ayịnufọk amọ amaasio anye ke esiin anyʌñ asịn etịñ udọk abaha anye. Anye akesịne mbana ewịra, sia akedo utọ afọñ ado ke mme mboppo nditọ adidem ekesịne. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Tama amaaduọk ntọñ ke iwuod amọ anyʌñ awai ewịra anye akesịneke. Anye amaadot ubọk amọ ke iwuod anyʌñ awuọ anyọñ, atua uyio asọñ naña anye anyọññọ.<verse eid="2SA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Absalọm ayịneka amọ amaabịp anye abo, “Nte Amnọn, ayịnete mfo, aba ye afo? Ayịneka mmi dop uyio, mbọk, sia anye ado ayịnete mfo. Kuuyak ñkpọ ami ufịna.” Ndin Tama amaadʌñ ke ufọk ayịneka amọ Absalọm, ke mfʌhọ.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Adidem Defid amaanekke ayat esịd ke anye akekoppo afịd ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Ñko Absalọm ikitañña ikọ ndomokeed ye Amnọn, me eti me idiọọk, anye amaasua Amnọn sia anye amaasuenne ayịneka amọ Tama.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Absalọm Awot Amnọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Ado isua iba akeboiyo, idaha mme akwaat ided edọñ Absalọm ekebaaha ke Baal Hasọ a-akpereke adaña Ifrem, anye amaakoot afịd nditọ ideen adidem abo edi do. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Absalọm amaakedọkkọ adidem abo, “Mme akwaadided edọñ mmi e-ediwuọ. Mbọk me adidem ye mme ikọd amọ eyaediñkeene ekaa?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Adidem amaabọọrọ ate, “Iyoo, ayịn mmi, ifọnnọ yak afịd ñnyịn ika, mbaak ñnyịn idido mfịna unọọ fiin.” Akpesʌkado Absalọm akesʌkkọ ayịre anye, anye ikinyịmmeke adika, ado adidem amaanọ anye adidiọñ.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Ndin Absalọm amaabo ate, “Imiidooho ntoro, mbọk yak ayịnete mmi Amnọn ikeene ñnyịn aka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Adidem amaabịp anye, “Ke nsoo ntak ke anye aduukeene?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Ado Absalọm amaasọñ ayịre, ndin anye amaanọ Amnọn ye nditọ ideen adidem mbon ñko ekeene anye.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Absalọm amaadọkkọ ikọd amọ ate, “Ikpañ utọñ! Amnọn amaanwọñ ukọd nọ akara anye ke idem, ndin ami ibo ndufo nte, ‘Itọ Amnọn inịm ke isọñ,’ ndin iwot anye. Ikiifeghe ndịk. Nte ami inọọhọ ndufo uyio ami? Isọñ adudu inyʌñ ikop uko.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ndin ikọd Absalọm emaenam Amnọn se Absalọm akenọọ ammọ uyio abo enam. Ndin afịd mme nditọ ideen adidem emaedaaña eda, edọọk dọñki ammọ enyʌñ efeeñe enyọñọ.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Etob ami amaakesịm Defid idem, ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ eka ke usʌñ: “Absalọm awoot afịd nditọ ideen adidem, awo ammọ ndomokeed isʌhọke.” <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Adidem amaadakka ada, awai afọñidem amọ anyʌñ asuuk anaa ke isọñ, ndin afịd nditọufọk amọ emaewai afọñ ke idem enyʌñ eba ye anye.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Ado Yọnadab, ayịn Simei, ayịneka Defid amaabo ate, “Ke abọọñ mmi akere abo ke ewoot afịd nditọ ideen adidem; sʌk Amnọn ikpọọñ akpa. Ami akedo akpan uduak Absalọm tọọñọ ke usen Amnọn akenaaha ayịneka amọ Tama ke ñkanubọk. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Ke abọọñ mmi afịna abaña etob a-abooho ke afịd nditọ ideen adidem ekpañña. Amnọn kpọd akpa.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Etaññatañ mi, Absalọm amaafeghe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Ndin awo a-akedaaha ukpeme amaakịt uwak awo ke usʌñ ke edem amọ, nte eto edi ke ñkañ abod. Awoukpeme ado amaakedọkkọ adidem abo, “Ami mmekịt ideen ke ubeñ ukañ Horonaim, ke ñkañ abod.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin; Hibru inieghe udịmikọ ami.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yọnadab amaabo adidem ate, “Sese nditọ ideen adidem enyọñ edi; atịppe kpa naña awo mfo aketañ.”<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Anye aketañ ama nditọ ideen adidem emaedʌk edi, etuaha uyio asọñ. Adidem ñko, mme afịd ikọd amọ emaetuaha eti-eti.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Absalọm amaafeghe abịne Talmai, ayịn Amihud, adidem Kesọọ. Ado adidem Defid amaatua ñkpa ayịn amọ akpeene usen.<verse eid="2SA 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Absalọm akedʌñ do isua ita, ke anye amaakefeghe aka Kesọọ. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Akem adidem Defid amaayem adika ñkese Absalọm, sia anye amaabọ idọñesịd abaña ñkpa Amnọn.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Absalọm Atịmme Anyọñ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoab, ayịn Seruya amaadiọọñọ ke itọñ Absalọm amaadọñ adidem. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ke ntoro, Yoab amaadọñ awo aka akedat awonwaan a-ayọhọke ye aniọñ ato abio Tekoa adi. Yoab amaadọkkọ mma ado ate, “Nam nte afo aba ke ikpo. Sịne mme afọñ ikpo, kuufiọññọ adan uyai ndomokeed. Nam nte awonwaan a-afʌhọke ñkpa awo ke uwak usen. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Do ndin kaa bịne adidem kedọkkọ anye ikọ ami.” Yoab amaasịn anye ikọ ke inua.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Ke awonwaan Tekoa amaakewuọ iso adidem, anye amaaduọ akʌp iso amọ ke isọñ akpono anye, ñko anye amaabo ate, “Ñnyaaña miin, O adidem mmi!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Adidem amaabịp anye abo, “Nsoo ñkpọ ufịna fiin?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ndo ebekpa; ebe mmi amaakpa. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Ami ayịnufọk mfo ñkenie nditọ ideen iba. Ammọ awo iba enwana ye emọ-emọ ke inwañ, awo ikibaaha se imuum ammọ. Keed amaatọ keed anyʌñ awot anye. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Idahami, afịd idịd ñnyịn e-edakka eda enam ikọ ye awo mfo, ete, ‘Sio andikitọ ayịneka, inọ ñnyịn iwot anye ke iwuod uwem ayịneka ake anye akewotto; ndin ñnyịn iyaisobo adiaakpa ñko.’ Ammọ eyem iniime ukweeñe ukañ i-ikañ asakka annọọ miin, mbaak anyịñ ebe mmi me ake ubon amọ adiba aba ke iso isọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Adidem amaadọkkọ mma ado ate, “Nyọñ ufọk, ami ñyaanọ uyio ke iwuod mfo.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Ado awonwaan a-atooho Tekoa amaabo adidem ate, “Yak abọọñ, adidem mmi afeen annọ miin ye ufọk mmi, ñko yak adidem ye ebekpo amọ anana ndudue.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Adidem amaabọọrọ anye ate, “Adieke awo ndomokeed uyemme ikọ, ben ammọ di mi, ndin ammọ iduufịnake fiin aba.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Anye amaadian do abo, “Yak adidem atommo anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ nọ akpan asiousiene ke iyiib akuudian nsobo, mbaak adisobo ayịn mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Adidem amaadian do, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, ided keed ke iwuod ayịn mfo idiiduọhọ ke isọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Awonwaan ado amaabo ate, “Yak ayịnufọk mfo atañ ikọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmi adidem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Adidem amaabo anye, “Tañ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Awonwaan ado amaabo, “Nsoo ido ndin yak afo anam utọ ñkpọ ami abaña ikọd Abasi? Ke ini adidem atañña ikọ ami, nte adidem ibiommo idem amọ ikpe, sia adidem ibenne ayịn amọ e-ekebịneke esio ke abio? <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Nte mmọọñ a-aduọkkọke ke isọñ, a-awo imiikanna ikoi aba, ntoro ana ñnyịn ikpañña. Ado, idooho se Abasi ayem ado ado; utu ke ado, anye asai mme usʌñ mbaak awo e-ekebịneke esio ke abio idooho ke nsi-nsi.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />“Ndin ami mmedi adidọkkọ abọọñ adidem mmi sia mme awo enam yak ndịk ammʌm miin. Ayịnufọk mfo akekere ate, ‘Ami ñyaatañ nnọ adidem; akemeido anye ayaanam ebeeñe ayịnufọk amọ. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Akemeido adidem ayaanyịmme adinyaaña ayịnufọk amọ nsio ke ubọk awo ayemme iñkpịkke miin mme ayịn mmi nsio ke nsʌhọ udeeme Abasi.’<verse eid="2SA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />“Do ndin ayịnufọk mfo abo, ‘Yak uyio abọọñ mmi adidem asọọñọ nsʌhọ udeeme mmi anịm annọ, sia abọọñ mmi adidem aba nte enyere Abasi ke adideet eti mme idiọọk nse. Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo aba ye afo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Akem adidem amaabo awonwaan ado ate, “Kuutre adinnọ ibọọrọ ikọ ami mbooho ubịp fiin mi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Awonwaan ado amaabo, “Yak abọọñ mmi adidem atañ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />“Nte ubọk Yoab isịneke ke afịd ñkpọ ami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Awonwaan ado amaabọọrọ ate, “Ma uwem mfo, abọọñ mmi ye adidem, awo ndomokeed ikemeke adiwọññọ ñkaa nnasia me ufiin ke abaña ñkpọ se abọọñ mmi ye adidem atañ. Ntoro, ado ayịnufọk mfo Yoab akentemme miin abo nnam ami anyʌñ adọñ afịd mme ikọ ami ke inua ayịnufọk mfo. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Awo mfo Yoab akenam ami nọ akpəho naña ñkpọ aba idahami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmi anie aniọñ nte ake enyere Abasi, anye adiọọñọ afịd ñkpọ se iba ke isọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Ndin adidem amaadọkkọ Yoab ate, “A-afọn, ñyaanam ñkpọ ami. Kaa, ke ben akparawa ado Absalọm nyọñ di.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoab amaaduọ ke isọñ akʌp iso amọ, akpono anye, anyʌñ akọọm adidem. Yoab amaabo, “Mfịn ami awo mfo adiọọñọ abo ke anye akịt mfọn ke anyen mfo, abọọñ mmi adidem, sia adidem anam ebeeñe ayịnufọk amọ.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ndin Yoab amaakaa Kesọọ akeben Absalọm atịmme adi ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Ado adidem amaabo ate, “Anye ana anyọñ ufọk amọ, inaaha anye akịt iso mmi.” Ndin Absalọm akenyọñ ufọk amọ, ikinyʌññọ ikịt iso adidem.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Ibaaha awo e-eketooroke ke uyai ke afịd Isrel nte Absalọm. Tọọñọ ke etịñiwuod amọ tutu ekaesịd ikpad amọ, ndo ndomokeed ikibaaha anye ke idem. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Ini akeedodo anye akefatta ided iwuod amọ, anye akesifat ided amọ akañ keed ke isua sia ided amaadoppo ibọhọ inọ anye, anye amaasisịn ke udomoñkpọ, ndin udob amọ akesido sekel ikie iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 2.3</char></note> ke udomoñkpọ adidem.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Absalọm akenie nditọ ideen ita ye ayịn awonwaan keed. Anyịñ ayịn awonwaan amọ akedo Tama, anye ñko akedo uyaiya awonwaan.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Absalọm akedʌñ ke Yeruselem isua iba, ado ikikịtte adidem iso. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ndin Absalọm amaadọñ ekoot Yoab nọ adọñ anye anọ adidem, ado Yoab amaasịn adidikịt anye. Anye amaamaana adọñ ayọhọ akañ iba, ado Yoab ikisʌkkọ idi. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ndin anye amaabo ikọd amọ, “Sese, inwañ Yoab ada akpere ake mmi, ñko anye anie baali do. Ikaa, ikisʌm ikañ isịn.” Ndin ikọd Absalọm emaefọp inwañ ado ke ikañ.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Ke akpatre, Yoab amaadika ufọk Absalọm, anyʌñ akebịp anye abo, “Nsoo ido nọ nditọufọk mfo esịn ikañ ke inwañ mmi?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Absalọm amaabo Yoab ate, “Sese, ami mmaadọñ utom unọ fiin ñnyʌñ mbo nte, ‘Di mi nọ udọñ yak akebịp adidem abo, “Ntak a-ami ñkenyọññọ ke Kesọọ ndi-e? Akpaakefọn ye ami adieke ñkpekesʌkkọ mba do!” ’ Ke ntoro, ami ñyem adikịt iso adidem, ñko akpedo ami mmedue ñkpọ ndomokeed, yak anye añwot miin.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ndin Yoab amaakaa akedọkkọ adidem ntoro. Akem adidem amaadọñ ekoot Absalọm, anye amaanyʌñ adʌk adi, anye adisuuk iso amọ ke isọñ ke iso adidem. Adidem ndin amaatʌm Absalọm inua.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Adu Ibak Absalọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Ke ini amaakekem, Absalọm amaanie sariọd ake idem amọ ye mme enañmbakara ye ideen awo aba mme duob esifegheke ke iso amọ. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Anye amaasibak ademme ke idab, akeda ke mben usʌñ e-etooho esaña edʌk inuaatob abio. Ini akeedodo awo akenieghe mfịna aben adinịm ke iso adidem yak enọ ubiere, Absalọm ayaabọñ akoot awo ado, abịp abo, “Akee abio ke afo ato?” Anye ayaabọọrọ, “Ayịnufọk mfo ato keed ke atu esiin Isrel.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Akem Absalọm ayaabo anye ate, “Se, ikọ mfo anen anyʌñ afọn, ado ibaaha awo se adidem anịm abo akop ikọ mfo.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Ndin Absalọm ayaadian do, abo, “Akpekapado emaemmek miin nte abiideikpe ke abio! Ñko afịd awo se inie mfịna me ikpe ekpaembịne miin, ami ñko ñkpaakịt mbo ke ammọ ebọ unen.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Ñko, ini akeedodo awo akesañake akpere anye adinuuk iwuod ke iso amọ, Absalọm ayaasio ubọk amọ anyan, amʌm anye anyʌñ atʌm anye inua. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Absalọm amaanam ntom ke utọ usʌñ ami ye afịd nditọ Isrel e-ekediighe ediyem unen eto adidem, ke ntoro anye amaawọññọ esịd nditọ Isrel anọ idem amọ.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Ke utịd ayọhọ isua inaañ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed, Siriak ye Yosefus; Hibru ado 40</char></note> Absalọm amaadọkkọ adidem ate, “Yak ami ñka ke Hibrọn ñkesio akaaña ami ñkenamma nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Ke ini awo mfo akedʌññọ ke Kesọọ ke Aram, ami mmaanam akaaña ami: ‘Adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ambenne miin atịmme aka Yeruselem, ami ñyaakpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Hibrọn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin; Hibru inieghe ke Hibrọn.</char></note>’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Adidem amaabo anye ate, “Kaa ke emem.” Ndin anye amaakaa Hibrọn.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Akem Absalọm amaadọñ mme ndịbe-ndịbe isʌñutom ekaiya afịd mme esiin Isrel ekebo ete, “Ndufo emaesʌk ekokop uyom mme adukpoñ, ndin ibo ite, Absalọm ado adidem ke Hibrọn.” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Ideen ikie iba (200) eketo Yeruselem ekeene Absalọm. Ekekoot ammọ nte mme isenawo, ammọ ekeka ke eti esịd, ikidiọọñọke ñkpọ ibaña edioomo ami. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Ke ini Absalọm anamma mme uwa, anye ñko amaadọñ abo ekoot Ahitofel awo Kilọ, adinọ Defid item, yak ato idʌñ amọ, Kido, adi. Do ndin adu ibak ami amaasọọñọ, ndin mbon se ikikeene Absalọm emaekaa iso etọt.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Afeghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Ndin isʌñutom amaadi anyʌñ adidọkkọ Defid abo, “Esịd nditọ Isrel adikappa aba ye Absalọm.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ke ntoro, Defid amaakoot afịd mme adaaha amọ e-ekebaaha ye anye ke Yeruselem ate, “Ndufo idi! Ana ñnyịn ifeeñe, imiidooho ntoro, awo ñnyịn ndomokeed idiibọkkọke Absalọm. Ana ñnyịn ikpọñ ini keed, mbaak anye adidi usọp-usọp adibọhọ ñnyịn, anyʌñ aben nsobo isọk ñnyịn, anyʌñ asobo abio ke akañkañ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Mme ikpọ mbon utom adidem emaebọọrọ anye ete, “Nditọ mfo ebeeñe idem edinam se adodo abọọñ ñnyịn adidem amekke.”<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Adidem amaasaña awuọ, ndin afịd ufọk amọ ekeene anye; ado amaanịm ibaan esiin duob nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña akwere adidem. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Ndin adidem amaadakka awuọ, afịd mme awo ekeene anye, ammọ ñko emaetuak eda ke mben abio. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Afịd ikọd amọ emaesaña ke udịm ke iso amọ, afịd mbon Kered ye Peled, ye afịd mbon Kid ikie itiokeed (600) ekekeeneke anye eto Kad emaesaña ke udịm ke iso adidem.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Adidem amaabịp Itai awo Kad abo ate, “Ntak afo akpikeeneke ñnyịn-e? Tịmme kaa keba ye adidem Absalọm. Afo ado asenawo, a-akekpọññọ isọñ emana mfo. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Ñkpọñ-ñkpọñ ami ke afo akedi. Ndin ami ñyaadinam nọ afo ikeene ñnyịn ayooñ mfịn, ke ini ami ndiidiọọñọke itie se ñka? Nyọñ kaa, nyʌñ koono ikọd mfo kaa. Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> uwọt fiin mfọn ye akpanikọ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin; Ke Hibru ado Yak mfọn ke akpanikọ aba ye afo</char></note>”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Ado Itai amaabọọrọ adidem abo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abaaha ke uwem, ye adaña nte abọọñ mmi adidem abaaha ke uwem, itie akeedodo abọọñ mmi adidem abaaha, me ado ke uwem me ke ñkpa, do ke ayịnufọk mfo adiiba.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Defid amaabo Itai, “Kaa iso, saña kaa.” Ndin Ittai, awo Kad, amaasaña akaa ye afịd ikọd amọ ye mme ubon e-ekebaaha ye anye.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Afịd awo ke esịd abio emaetuaha ke akpọsọñ uyio naña afịd mme awo ekesañake eboiyo. Adidem ñko amaakaaña Abedeñ Kidrọn, ndin afịd awo emaeboiyo ekaa iso ke usʌñ anaan.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Sadọk ñko akeba do, afịd mme Lifai se ikiba ye anye ekebiom akebe edioomo Abasi. Ammọ emaesuuhọ akebe edioomo enịm, ndin Abiata amaanam mme uwa tutu afịd mme awo ekpọñ abio ema.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Akem adidem amaadọkkọ Sadọk abo, “Ben akebe edioomo Abasi tịmme dʌk abio. Adieke ñkịtte mfọn ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye ayaamaana amben anyọñ nọ ndikịt anye ye itie idʌñ amọ. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Ado anye akpebo, ‘Ami nnemme esịd ye afo,’ ndin ami mmebeeñe idem, yak anye anam ye ami se adodo a-afọnnọ ye anye.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Adidem amaanyʌñ adọkkọ aku Sadọk ate, “Unwaña fiin? Tịmme kaa abio ye adidiọñ mmi. Ben ayịn mfo Ahimaas yak asaña ye afo, ye Yọnatan ayịn Abiata ñko. Afo ye Abiata itịmme ikaa ye nditọ ndufo iba. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Ami ñyaabet ke itie ukod mmọọñ ke anaan tutu afo anọ uyio do adiñwuọ idem.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Ke ntoro Sadọk ye Abiata emaeben akebe edioomo Abasi etịmme enyọñ Yeruselem enyʌñ ekeba do.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Ado Defid amaakaa iso tutu akewuọ Abod Ọlif, asaña atua, amaafʌk iwuod amọ, asaña ke ukpọk ikpad. Afịd awo se ikisaña mme anye emaefuuk iwuod ammọ ñko, ñko esaña etua. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ñko emaedọkkọ Defid ebo, “Ahitofel ado keed ke atu mbon edioomo ibak Absalọm.” Ndin Defid amaabọñ akam abo ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kappa item Ahitofel sịn ke ndisịme.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Ke ini Defid amaakedọọk ikiwuọ anyọñ abod, ke itie mme awo ekesikponoke Abasi, Husai, awo Akaid amaaba do adisoobo ye anye, ewịra amọ amaawaiya, ntọñ amaayọhọ anye iwuod. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Defid amaabo anye, “Afo akpeñkeene miin asaña, afo uduudo ñkpọ mbiomo annọ miin. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Ado afo akpenyọñ aka abio akebo Absalọm, ‘Adidem mmi, ami ñyaado ayịnufọk mfo; ami ñkedo ayịnufọk ete mfo ke usen edem, ado idahami, ami ndiido ayịnufọk mfo.’ Ndin afo amekeme iñnyaaña miin ke adibiat item Ahitofel. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Nte mme aku Sadọk ye Abiata idiibaaha do mme afo? Dọkkọ ammọ ñkpọ akeedodo a-afo akoppo ke akwere adidem. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Nditọ ammọ iba, Ahimaas ayịn Sadọk ye Yọnatan ayịn Abiata, mmọdo ebaña mme ammọ. Se afo akokop, dọñ ammọ nọ edindọkkọ.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ndin Husai, ataa awo idem Defid, amaakesịm Yeruselem ke idaha Absalọm akedʌkkọ abio.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Defid ye Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Ke ini Defid amaakesaña etək ibọhọ etịñe abod, Siba ayịnufọk Mefibosed, amaawuọ adibet, ayem adisoobo ye anye. Anye amaaben mme dọñki ke udịm adi, ekebọppọ mbiomo efọk uyo ikie iba (200), kek ake resịn ikie (100), kek ake fik ikie (100) ye ukọd ke ikịm keed.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Adidem amaabịp Siba, “Nsoo inam nọ afo akoono afịd ñkpọ ami adi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba amaabọọrọ ate, “Mme dọñki ado se mbon ufọk adidem ewat, uyo ye mfịd edoñño se ideen edia, ndin ukọd anie mbon se idem amem nọ ademme adudu ammọ ke anaan.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Adidem amaabịp abo, “Ayeyịn eteufọk mfo aba ke mmọọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Siba amaabọọrọ abo, “Anye aba ke Yeruselem, sia anye akere ate, ‘Esiin Isrel eyaekappa ebekpo ubọọñ etebom mmi ennọ miin mfịn ami.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Ndin adidem amaabo Siba ate, “Afịd ñkpọ se ikiinie Mefibosed adido ake mfo idahami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siba amaabo ate, “Ami mmenyuuk iwuod unọ. Yak ñkịt mfọn ke iso mfo, abọọñ mmi adidem.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simei Asuuñọ Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Idaha adidem Defid akesañake akpere Bahurim, awodeen keed a-aketooho ukem ubon nte Sọọl amaawuọ ato do adi. Anyịñ amọ akedo Simei, ayịn Kera, anye amaasaña ye isuuñọ naña asañake awuọ adi. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Anye amaatọọñ Defid ye afịd mme adaaha adidem ke itiad, akpesʌkado afịd mbonekọñ ye mbon asaña-asaña ukpeme ekebaaha ke ubọk nnasia ye ufiin Defid. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Naña anye asueghe mi, anye Simei amaabo, “Wuọ mi, wuọ mi, afo awodawo, afo abʌd-abʌd awo! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> u-usio fiin usiene ke afịd iyiib a-afo akeduọkkọ ke ubon Sọọl, ake afo adaaha ukara ke itie amọ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akappa abio asịn ke ubọk ayịn mfo Absalọm. Mbiara usịm fiin, sia afo ado awodawo!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Ndin Abisai, ayịn Seruya amaabo adidem ate, “Nsoo ido ntak adukpo ewa ami akpesueghe abọọñ mmi adidem? Yak ami ñka do ñkekpịkke iwuod amọ nsio.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Ado adidem amaabo, “Ñkpọ ami ibeghe die ndufo, nditọ Seruya? Adieke anye asuuñọke sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ anye abo ‘Suuñọ Defid,’ anie awo akeme adibịp mbo, ‘Nsoo ido nọ afo anam ami?’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Akem Defid amaabo Abisai ye afịd mme adaaha amọ ate, “Ayịn awodeen mmi, abʌk ye iyiib ake mmi, asʌk anwana adiñwot. Nwaanwa dise, ndin, awo Benyamin ami! Saana anye yaak; yak anye asuuñọ, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo anye anam ntoro. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Akeme adido <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakịt ukuud mmi anyʌñ atịmme annọ adidiọñ edioomo amọ, utu ke isuuñọ amọ mfịn.”<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ndin Defid ye ikọd amọ emaekaa iso esaña ke usʌñ ke ini Simei akekaaha ke nsakiso Defid ke ukañ abod, asaña asʌk asuuñọ, atoomo itiad anyʌñ aduọk Defid mbad. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Ndin adidem ye ikọd amọ emaekewuọ utịd itie isañ ammọ, ye mmemidem. Ke ndo ke anye akeduọk adudu, adia ndidia.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Item ake Ahitofel ye Husai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Akem Absalọm ye afịd nditọ Isrel emaedi ke Yeruselem, ñko Ahitofel amaaba ye anye. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Ndin Husai awo Akaid, ataa awo Defid, amaakaa akebo Absalọm ate, “Yak itọñ uwem asọñ adidem! Yak itọñ uwem asọñ adidem!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Absalọm amaabo Husai, “Awuọ anye ami ado ima a-afo awọttọ ufan mfo? Akpedo anye ado ufan mfo, nsoo ido yak afo ukudukeeneke anye ufeghe?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Husai amaabo Absalọm ate, “Iyoo, anye se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amek, ato ibon ami, ye afịd ideen ke Isrel, ake amọ ke ami ndiido, ami ndiinyʌñ nsʌk nda ye anye. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Akanna ado, anie ke ami ñkpenam ñkpọ nnọ? Ikpinaaha ami nnam ñkpọ nnọ ayịn? Kpa naña ami ñkenam ñkpọ nnọ ete mfo, kpa ntoro ke ami ndiinam unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Absalọm amaabo Ahitofel, “Inọ ñnyịn item mfo. Nsoo ke ñnyịn ikpinam?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofel amaabọọrọ Absalọm, “Naa ye ibaan esa ete mfo, a-anye akebonno abo ese ñkpọ ebaña akwere amọ. Ke ntoro afịd Isrel eyaekop ebo ke afo amaakappa ado ñkpọ mbubiam ke iso ete mfo, ndin ami ayaasọọñọ ubọk afịd mbon awo se iba ye afo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Do ndin emaetuak atayad enọ Absalọm ke anyọñ ufọk, anye ñko amaakaa akena ye ibaan esa ete amọ ke iso afịd Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Ke mme usen ado, item se Ahitofel akesinọ akesiba nte ake awo a-abịppe ato Abasi. Ke utọ usʌñ ami ke Defid ye Absalọm ekesidat item Ahitofel.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitofel amaadọkkọ Absalọm ate, “Ami ñyaasio tọsịn ideen duob mme iba ñnyʌñ ñwuọ mbịne Defid akonayio mfịn. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Ami ñyaanwana ye anye ini ekaha ye idaha idem amemme anye. Ami ñyaanam anye akop ataa ekamba ndịk, ndin afịd mbon se iba ye anye eyaefeeñe. Adidem kpọd ke ndiiwot <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />ñnyʌñ ñkoono afịd awo ñnyọñ mben usọk fiin. Ñkpa awo anye afo ayemme ayaakappa anam afịd awo etịmme ubịne fiin; unọmọ idiisịmme awo ndomokeed.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Uduak ami akeba nte amaafọn ye Absalọm ye afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Ado Absalọm amaabo ate, “Edọñ ekoot Husai awo Akaid adi ñko, nọ ñnyịn ikop se anye anie aditañ ñko.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Husai akedisoobo anye, Absalọm amaadọkkọ anye ate, “Ahitofel amaanọ item amọ. Nte ñnyịn inam se anye abo? Imiidooho ntoro, inọ ñnyịn akikere mfo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Husai amaabọọrọ Absalọm ate, “Item Ahitofel anọọhọ isañ anye ami ifọnnọ. <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Husai amaadian do abo, afo amediọọñọ ete mfo ye ikọd amọ, ammọ edo mbon anwan, a-adooho ammọ esọñ adudu nte amọnikọd ewappake nsek nditọ ebọ. Ke amaaboiyo ado, ete mfo anie ifiọk anwan akpeene; anye idiinaaha keed ye mbonekọñ. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Akpekọm idahami, anye adịbe ke abaitiad me ke itie mfen. Adieke anye atooho atọọñọ ekọñ ye mbon ekọñ mfo, awo akeedodo a-akoppo ayaabo ate, ‘Nduwotto nsobo aba ke atu mbonekọñ e-ekeeneke Absalọm.’ <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Akọm awo ekọñ se ikop uko ñkan, ake esịd amọ abaaha nte esịd ekpe, ayaayeeme ye ndịk, sia afịd Isrel ediọọñọ ke ete mfo ado anwana anwan, ñko ke mbon se iba ye anye ekop uko.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />“Do ndin, item mmi ado ami: Yak afịd Isrel, tọọñọ ke Daan kewuọ Beeseba, ewakka nte ntan ke mben inyañ, ewuọ edibono itie keed unọ fiin, nọ afo ke idem mfo adat ammọ usʌñ ke iso ekọñ. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Ndin ñnyịn iyainwana ye anye ke itie akeedodo ikemeke adikịt anye, ñnyịn iyainyʌñ iduọ ifʌk anye nte mbara aduọ ke isọñ. Anye me awo keed ke atu ikọd amọ idiibọkkọke. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Anye akpetịmme edem adʌk ke esịd abio, ndin afịd Isrel eyaekoono mme udʌk eka abio ado, ndin ñnyịn iyainyʌñ idʌt anye isịn ke abedeñ, tutu etək ñkpọ nte ñkwaitiad isʌhọke.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Absalọm ye afịd ideen ke Isrel emaebo ete, “Item Husai, awo Akaid, afọn akan ake Ahitofel.” Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanyịmme adisuan eti item Ahitofel nọ aben nsobo asọk Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Akem Husai amaadọkkọ mme aku Sadọk ye Abiata ate, “Ahitofel amaatemme Absalọm ye mme ñkpisọñ Isrel ate yak enam ami mme ako, ado ami mmebo ammọ yak enam ntom mme ntom. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Do ndin, dọñ etob ini keed nọ edọkkọ Defid ebo, ‘Kuunaa ukpere itie ukod mmọọñ ke anaan akonayio mfịn, kuutre adisaña ñkaaña mboiyo, mbaak adidem ye afịd ikọd amọ edikịt nsobo.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yọnatan ye Ahimaas ekeba ke En Rokel. Ayịnufọk awonwaan akenie adikidọkkọ ammọ, ñko akena ammọ eka eketañ enọ adidem Defid, sia ammọ ikpikiyemme yak ekịt naña mmimọ idʌkkọ abio. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Ado akparawa keed amaakịt ammọ anyʌñ akedọkkọ Absalọm. Ndin ammọ awo iba emaekpọñ ini keed ekedʌk ufọk awodeen keed ke Bahurim. Anye amaanie ube mmọọñ ke esịd atʌñ amọ, ndin ammọ emaesọiyọ edʌk do. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Anwaan amọ amaaben ufʌkñkpọ abịt ke inua ube ado anyʌñ asuan ñkpasi ayọhọ anyọñ ado. Awo ndomokeed ikidiọọñọke ñkpọ ibaña.<verse eid="2SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ke ini ikọd Absalọm emaekediwuọ ufọk awonwaan ado, ammọ emaebịp ebo, “Ahimaas ye Yọnatan eba ke mmọọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Awonwaan ado amaabọọrọ ammọ abo, “Ammọ emaekaaña idịm efrọ.” Ideen ado emaeyem ado ikikịtte awo ndomokeed, ndin ammọ emaetịmme enyọñ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Ammọ ekenyọñọ, ammọ awo iba emaedọọk ewuọñọ ke ube enyʌñ ekaa ekedọkkọ adidem Defid. Ammọ ekebo anye ete, “Dakka da nyʌñ kaaña boiyo inyañ ini keed, Ahitofel atemme Absalọm ntom mme ntom ubaña fiin.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Ndin Defid ye afịd mbon awo se ikiba ye anye emaedaaña ekaaña Yọdan. Ayio atisiere, ikibaaha awo ndomokeed idiikikaañake Yọdan.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofel akekịt ke awo ikikeeneke item amọ, anye amaadọọk atie ke dọñki amọ, adakka anyọñ ufọk amọ ke abio idʌñ amọ. Anye amaanekke ufọk amọ anịm anyʌñ ayịt idem amọ ekpan. Ndin anye amaakpa enyʌñ ebuuk anye ke udi ete amọ.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Absalọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Defid amaakaa akewuọ Mahanaim, Absalọm ñko amaakaaña Yọdan ye afịd nditọ ideen Isrel. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Absalọm amaamek Amasa nte etubom ekọñ ke itie Yoab. Amasa akedo ayịn Yeta, awo Ismeel, akedọọhọ Abikel, ayịn awonwaan Nahas mme ayịneka awonwaan Seruya, eka Yoab. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Mbon Isrel ye Absalọm ekenam nnaaekọñ ke Kilied.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Ke ini Defid amaakediwuọ Mahanaim, Sobi ayịn Nahas a-atooho Raba ke Amọn ye Makia ayịn Amiel a-atooho Lo Deba, ye Basilai awo Kilied a-atooho Rokelịm <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />emaekoono mme afọñ nnaa, ntəño usan ye mme ñkpọ e-ebotto ke aduañ edi. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ekoono mme ñkpọ ami esọk Defid ye ikọd amọ ebo edia: wiid, baali, ndomuyo, nsaad mfịd, akọti ye nsama, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />yak enọ Defid ye mbon amọ adanakwọọk ye bọta edọñ ye bọta ake mmọọñeba enañ yak edia. Sia ammọ ekebo ete, ke “Abiọọñ adọñ mme awo; itọñ asat, idem anyʌñ amem ammọ ke anaan.”<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Defid amaakoot ideen se ikiba ye anye abok anyʌñ amek mme adaiso ekọñ yak ekara mme tọsịn (1,000) ye mme ikie (100). <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Defid amaabakka mbon ekọñ amọ ke itie ita, Yoab akama mbakka keed, ayịneka Yoab, Abisai, ayịn Seruya akama keed, ndin Itai awo Kad akama ayọhọ udịmekọñ ita. Adidem amaadọkkọ mbon ekọñ abo, “Ami ke idem mmi ñyaakeene ñwuọ ndi ye ndufo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Ado ikọd amọ emaedọkkọ anye ebo, “Inaaha afo awuọ adi; sia adieke akedooho se ñnyịn ifeeñe, ammọ idiibịneke ñnyịn. Akpekọm mbakka iba ke atu ñnyịn ikpañña, idiibegheke ammọ, sia afo aba nte ñnyịn awo tọsịn duob (10,000). Ndin, akap afọn afo aditie ke abio inọọ ñnyịn unwam.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Adidem amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ñyaanam se adodo a-afọnnọ ye ndufo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Ke ntoro, adidem amaada ke ñkañ inuaatob ke ini afịd ikọd amọ esañake ke udịm ke mme ikpeghe ikie (100) ye mme ikpeghe tọsịn (1,000) ewuọñọ. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Adidem amaanọ Yoab, Abisai mme Itai uyio abo ate, “Ndufo inam usʌk-usʌk ye akparawa ado Absalọm, ke ntak mmi.” Afịd mbonekọñ emaekop naña adidem anọọhọ mme adaiso ekọñ keedekeed uyio abaña Absalọm.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Mbon ekọñ Defid emaesaña ke udịm ewuọñọ ke abio ekaa adinwana ye mbonekọñ Isrel, iso ekọñ ami akedo ke akai Ifrem. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Do ke ikọd Defid ekesobo mbonekọñ Isrel, ñko ataa uwak awo emaekpañña, awo tọsịn edịb (20,000). <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Anwan amaatara akewuọ afịd esịdidʌñ, mme ibad awo se akai akedia usen ado amaawak akan se ikikpañña ke akañkañ.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Ndin Absalọm amaakesoobo ye ikọd Defid. Anye akewat ke anyọñ ñwaahadọñki amọ, ñko naña ñwaahadọñki ado akedʌkkọ ke idak uwak ñkọk ekandịk eto afriyo, ided Absalọm amaakọbọ ke eto ado. Ado amaanam anye akọñọ ufuum ke anyọñ, ado ñwaahadọñki anye akewatta amaaboiyo akpọñ anye.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Keed ke atu ikọd Defid akekịt se ikitịppe, anye amaadọkkọ Yoab abo, “Ami mmekịt Absalọm idaha ado nte akọñọ ke afriyo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoab amaabịp awo a-akedọkkọke anye ikọ ami ate, “Nsoo! Afo amaakịt anye? Nsoo ikido nọ afo umuukutọọhọ anye uduọk ke isọñ ke ndo? Ndin ami ñkpaakunọ fiin sekel silfa duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 12</char></note> ye ñkpahaisịn awo ekọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Ado awo ado amaabọọrọ Yoab abo, “Akpekọm ekpedomo tọsịn (1,000) ekpaubọk silfa edọñ ke ubọk mmi, ami ñkpituuhọ ayịn adidem ubọk. Sia adidem amaunọ fiin, Abisai ye Itai uyio abo, ‘Kpeme akparawa ado Absalọm, ke ntak mmi.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Ñko akpedo ami mmaasịn uwem mmi ke idiọọk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido akpedo mmaanam ñkara ye anye</char></note>, ndin ñkpọ ndomokeed idịbeke adidem, afo akpaakekanna edem añwọt miin.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoab amaabo ate, “Ami nnieghe utọ ini ado adida ubet fiin.” Ndin anye amaadat usaam ita ke ubọk amọ anyʌñ akịm Absalọm esịd, ke ini Absalọm imiikikpaaha diin ke ufọọd eto afriyo. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ndin, mbon ukama ñkpọ ekọñ Yoab duob emaekanna Absalọm ekʌk enyʌñ etọ anye ewọt.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Akem Yoab amaafịt adukpoñ, ndin mbonekọñ emaetre edibịne mbonekọñ Isrel, sia Yoab amaakpan ammọ. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Ammọ emaeben Absalọm etop esịn ke ekamba ube ke akai enyʌñ efop ikpọ eboho itiad efʌk anye. Idaha ado, afịd mbonekọñ Isrel emaefeeñe enyọñọ ufọk ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Ke ini uwem amọ, Absalọm amaaben adaaha anyʌñ awuuk anịm ke Abedeñ Adidem nte ñkpọ aditoiyo nnọọ idem amọ, sia anye akekere abo, “Ami nnieghe ayịn adiinam yak etoiyo anyịñ mmi.” Anye amaasio adaaha ado anyịñ adian idem amọ, enyʌñ ekoot Adaaha Absalọm tutu mfịn.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Atua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Akem Ahimaas ayịn Sadọk amaabo ate, “Yak ami mfeghe ndat etob ami nsọk adidem sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atoppo anye ikpe anyʌñ asio anye ke ubọk mme asua amọ.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoab amaabo anye ate, “Inaaha afo aben etob ami asọk adidem mfịn ami. Afo amekeme adikidọkkọ anye usen mfen, ado kuukaa mfịn, sia ayịn adidem akpa.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ami akeboiyo, Yoab amaabo awo Kus ate, “Kaa, kedọkkọ adidem se afo akịt.” Awo Kuus ami amaanyuuk iwuod ke iso Yoab anyʌñ afeghe akaa.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaas ayịn Sadọk amaamaana abo Yoab ate, “Naña akpedodo, mbọk, yak ami mfeghe ñkeene awo Kuus ke edem.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Ado Yoab amaabọọrọ anye abo, “Ayịn mmi, nsoo ido nọ afo asʌk ayịre adika? Afo unieghe etob ndomokeed se idiidat udod unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Anye amaana abo ate, “Naña akpedodo, ami ñyem adifeghe ñkaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Yoab ndin abo anye ate, “Feghe!” Do ndin Ahimaas amaafeghe ke usʌñ unaisọñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho unaisọñ Yọdan</char></note> anyʌñ aboiyo awo Kuus iso akewuọ.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Ke ini Defid aketieghe ke ufọọd esịd inuaatob ye ake anwa, awoukpeme amaakaa akedọọk anyọñ akọm inuaatob ke ñkañ ndibene. Anye akekonno ase anwa, amaakịt awodeen nte afeghe ikpọọñ adi. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Awoukpeme ado amaabọñ akoot adidem anyʌñ adọkkọ anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Adidem amaabo ate, “Adieke adooho ikpọọñ, awuọñọ ke ana ado anye akama eti etob.” Akem, afeghe itọk ado amaasaña anekke adikpere.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Ndin andikpeme amaakịt awo mfen nte afeghe adi, do ndin anye abọñ adọkkọ andikpeme inuaatob, abo, “Se, awo mfen afegheke ko adi ikpọọñ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Adidem amaabo, “Ana ado anye aben eti mbʌk adi ñko.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Awoukpeme amaabo ate, “Amba miin nte akpa awo afeghe itọk nte Ahimaas, ayịn Sadọk.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Adidem amaabo ate, “Anye ado eti awo. Anye aben eti etob adi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Akem Ahimaas amaabọñ akoot adidem abo, “Afịd ñkpọ afọn!” Anye amaanyuuk iwuod ke isọñ ke iso adidem, abo, “Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo! Anye asio mbon se ikidịppe ubọk ammọ inyan abọọñ mmi adidem.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Adidem amaabịp abo, “Ñkọ inieghe se inam akparawa ado, Absalọm?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaas amaabọọrọ abo ate, “Ami mmaakịt ndutịme kpa ke ini Yoab akeyemme adidọñ awo adidem ye ami utom, ado ami ndiọọñọke se ikido.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Ndin adidem amaabo anye, “Sịkke nyʌñ da ko.” Ke ntoro anye amaasịkke anyʌñ akeda do.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Akem awo Kuus amaadiwuọ anyʌñ abo ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmi adidem, kop eti etob ami! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ikpe utoppo fiin mfịn, ke adusio fiin ke ubọk afịd mbon se ikidakka ida inwana ye afo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Adidem amaabịp awo Kuus ate, “Ñkọ inieghe se inam akparawa ado Absalọm?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Awo Kuus amaabọọrọ ate, “Yak mme asua abọọñ mmi adidem ye afịd mbon se idakka ida adunam fiin ibak eba nte akparawa ado.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ami amaanyeeñe adidem. Anye amaadọọk akaa ubeed ke anyọñ inuaatob aketua ayịd. Naña anye akaaha, anye amaabo ate: “O Absalọm ayịn mmi! Ayịn awodeen mmi, ayịn mmi Absalọm. Ami ñkpekekappa ñkpa ke iwuod mfo, O Absalọm, ayịn mmi, ayịn awodeen mmi!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ñwed Hibru ufañ ami 2 Sa 18:33 ewet 2 Sam 19:1</char></note><verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">19: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ñwed Hibru 2 Sa 19:1-43 ewet 2 Sam 19:2-44</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Emaedọkkọ Yoab ebo ete, “Adidem asʌk atua anyʌñ afʌhọ abaña Absalọm.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Ke ntoro, adikan ke ekọñ usen ado amaakanna adʌk ke mfʌhọ anọ afịd mbonekọñ, sia ke usen ado mbonekọñ emaekop nte etañ ebo ete, “Adidem afʌhọ abaña ayịn amọ.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ideen emaedịbe edʌk abio usen ado nte ideen esaña inọ-inọ edʌk abio ke abuud ammọ emaefeeñe ke iso ekọñ. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Adidem amaafʌk iso amọ anyʌñ atua uyio asọñ ate, “O ayịn mmi Absalọm! O Absalọm, ayịn mmi, ayịn mmi!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Akem Yoab amaadika ufọk adidem anyʌñ akebo anye ate, “Mfịn afo amesuenne afịd ideen mfo, e-ekefakka uwem mfo, uwem nditọ ideen ye nditọ ibaan mfo, ibaan ndọ ye ibaan esiin mfo. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Afo ama mbon u-usuaha fiin anyʌñ asua mbon u-umaaha fiin. Afo amenam nọ ediọọñọ mfịn ami ke mme adaiso ekọñ ye mme ikọd ammọ idooho ñkpọ ndomokeed unọ fiin. Ami mmenekke ñkịt ke akpaunem fiin esịd adieke Absalọm akpebaaha ke uwem mfịn ndin afịd ñnyịn ikpikikpañña? <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Wuọ idahami kaa kenọ ikọd mfo nsọọñọukod. Ami mmenwọñọ ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mbo ke afo umuuwuọhọ uka, awo ndomokeed idiidaaha ye afo aba ke ayio atikịm. Anye ami ayaadiọọk ye afo akan afịd mme afanekọñ se afo akịt tọọñọ ke uyịn mfo tutu idahami.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Ndin adidem amaadakka ada akedat itie ke inuaatob. Ekedọkkọ mbon ekọñ ebo, “Adidem mmọdo atie ke inuaatob,” afịd ammọ emaewuọ edi iso amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Etañña mmi, nditọ Isrel emaefeeñe enyọñọ mme ufọk ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Atịmme Anyọñ Akaa Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Ke afịd mme esiin Isrel, afịd awo emaedutañña ke atu idem ammọ ete, “Adidem amaifak ñnyịn asio ke ubọk mme asua ñnyịn; anye akisio ñnyịn ke ubọk mbon Filistia. Ado idahami anye amaafeghe akpọñ abio yak anye abọkkọ ke ubọk Absalọm; <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />ñko Absalọm, ake ñnyịn ikiyette adan inịm yak ikara ñnyịn, akpa ke ikọd ekọñ. Ndin nsoo ido yak ndufo imiitañña ñkpọ ibaña adiben adidem ñnyọñ ndi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Adidem Defid amaadọñ etob ami anọ esọk mme aku Sadọk ye Abiata, abo: “Ibịp mme ñkpisọñ Yuda ibo, ‘Nsoo ido ntak a-ndufo ekpedooho akpatre ke adiben adidem ntịmme ñkaa akwere amọ, sia afịd ñkpọ se etañ ke afịd Isrel a-adisịm adidem utọñ ke ufọk amọ? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Ndufo edo ayakka mmi, abʌk mme iyiib mmi. Ndin ntak a-ndufo edooho akpatre adiben adidem ntịmme ñnyọñ-ọ?’ <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Inyʌñ idọkkọ Amasa ibo, ‘Ado nte afo udooho abʌk mme iyiib mmi? Yak Abasi anam ye ami, anyʌñ akaka iso anam akan ado, afo umuudooho adaiso mbon ekọñ mmi ke afịd ayio uwem ke itie Yoab.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Ke utọ usʌñ ami, adidem amaadep mme esịd mbon Yuda, ado amaanam ammọ edo esịd keed. Ndin ammọ emaedọñ etob enọ adidem, ebo, “Nyọñ di, afo ye afịd ikọd mfo.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Adidem amaanyʌñ atịmme anyọñ akaa, adʌk akewuọ Yọdan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Akem ikọd Yuda emaekaa Kilkal adikisoobo ye adidem ñnyʌñ mben anye ñkaaña mboiyo Yọdan. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Simei ayịn Kera, awo Benyamin ake Bahurim, amaasọsọp akaa ye ikọd Yuda adikisoobo ye Adidem Defid. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Anye akesaña ye mbon ubon Benyamin awo tọsịn keed (1,000), ye Siba, ayịnufọk ake esịd ufọk Sọọl, ye nditọ ideen amọ duob mme ition ye nditọufọk edịb. Ammọ emaekaa Yọdan usọp-usọp, ke itie adidem akebaaha. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Ammọ emaekaaña etək ukod mmọọñ adikiben mbon ufọk adidem ñkaaña ñnyọñ ye adikinam se adodo adidem akeyemme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Ke ini Simei ayịn Kera akekaañake Yọdan, anye amaaduọ anaa ke iso adidem <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />anyʌñ abo anye ate, “Yak abọọñ mmi akuumʌm ndudue mmi akama. Kuutoiyo idiọọk ido ayịnufọk mfo akenamma ke usen abọọñ mmi adidem akekpọññọ Yeruselem. Yak adidem ansio miin ke esịd amọ. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Sia ami ayịnufọk mfo mmediọọñọ mbo ke ami mmenam idiọọkñkpọ, ado mfịn ami mmedi mi nte akpa awo ke mme esiin Yosef, adisọiyọ ndi adisoobo ye abọọñ mmi adidem.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Akem Abisai ayịn Seruya amaabo ate, “Ikpinaaha nte ewot Simei ke idiọọk ido amọ? Anye akesuuñọ awo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyette adan anịm.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Ado Defid amaabọọrọ ate, “Nsoo ubeghe fiin do, ndufo nditọ ideen Seruya? Nsoo unen ke ndufo enie adisịn uyio ke ikọ ami? Awuọ ana ewot awo ndomokeed ke Isrel mfịn ami? Ado nte ami ndiọọñọke mbo ke ndo adidem ke Isrel mfịn ami?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ndin adidem amaadọkkọ Simei ate, “Afo uduukpaaha.” Adidem akenam ami ke enwọñọ anọ anye.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosed, ayeyịn Sọọl, amaasọiyọ adi ñko adisoobo ye adidem. Anye ikiseeghe ñkpọ ibaña ukod amọ me adikwaat ñwaebek me adiyet afọñidem amọ tọọñọ ke usen adidem akekpọññọ tutu usen anye akenyọññọ adi ke ifuuro. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ke ini anye a-aketooho Yeruselem adisoobo ye adidem, adidem amaabịp anye abo, “Mefibosed, nsoo ikido nọ afo umuukuñkeeneke miin ukaa?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosed amaabo ate, “Abọọñ mmi adidem, sia ami ayịnufọk mfo ndooho mbʌñọ, ami ñkebo, ‘Ami ñyaadọọk ntie ke anyọñ dọñki mmi, ñnyʌñ ñwat anye, ndin ami ñkeene ñkaa ye adidem.’ Ado Siba, ayịnufọk mmi, amambiaña miin. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Ñko anye amaasappa awo mfo ke iso abọọñ mmi adidem. Abọọñ mmi adidem aba nte enyere Abasi; do ndin nam se adodo afo ayemme. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Afịd nditọnditọ etebom mmi idotto ñkpọ ndomokeed ito abọọñ mmi adidem ibọhọke ñkpa, ado afo akenọọ awo mfo itie ke atu mbon se idia ndidia ke akpokoro mfo. Ndin, nsoo unen ke ami nnie adinam ebeeñe mfen nto adidem?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Adidem amaabo anye ate, “Ufọn afo aditañ aba? Ami mmunọ fiin ye Siba unen adibakka isọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefibosed amaadọkkọ adidem ate, “Yak anye akoono afịd ñkpọ, sia abọọñ mmi adidem amaakenyọñ idi ufọk ke emem.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Basilai awo Kilied amaanyʌñ ato Rokelịm asọiyọ adi adisaña ye adidem ñkaaña Yọdan yak anyʌñ aben anye akesuuk ke edem inyañ uko. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Basilai amaanekke akpon ke isua emana, anye akesọñ isua anaañ. Anye akenọọ adidem mme ñkpọ se akama adu uwem ke idaha adidem akedʌññọ ke Mahanaim, sia anye akedo ekamba awo inie. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Adidem amaabo Basilai ate, “Ñkeene miin saña kaaña inyañ nyʌñ diba ye ami ke Yeruselem, ndin ami ñyaase ñkpọ ubaña fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Ado Basilai amaabọọrọ adidem abo, “Isua ifañ isʌhọ ami adidu uwem, yak ado se ami ndiikeene adidem ñkaa Yeruselem? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Ami ndo isua anaañ idahami. Nte awo mfo akeme adikop inem ñkpọ se anye adia me se anwọñ? Nte ami mmesʌk ñkan ñkop uyio ideen ye ibaan mme akwọikwọ? Ntak a-awo mfo akpedianake ado mbiomo anọ abọọñ mmi adidem-e? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Awo mfo ayaasaña etək-etək akaaña edem Yọdan ye adidem, ado ntak adidem akpennọọhọ miin utọ ukpono ami-e? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Mbọk, yak awo mfo atịmme anyọñ, yak ami ñkekpa ke idʌñ mmi, ñkpere itiad udi ete ye eka mmi. Ado, se awo mfo Kimham mi. Yak anye asaña ye abọọñ mmi adidem akaaña inyañ. Ndin nam ye anye se akpedodo afo ayemme.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Adidem amaabo ate, “Kimham ayañkeene miin ikaaña ika, ñko ami ñyaanam ye anye se akpedodo afo ayemme. Ndin se adodo ake afo ayemme anto miin, ami ñyaanam unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ndin afịd mme awo emaekaaña eboiyo Yọdan, adidem ñko amaakaaña aboiyo. Adidem amaatʌm Basilai inua anyʌñ adiọñ anye anyʌñ akọọm anye unyọñ, Basilai amaanyʌñ atịmme anyọñ ufọk amọ.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Adidem amaakekaaña ikiwuọ Kilkal, Kimham ñko amaaboiyo ye anye. Afịd udịmekọñ Yuda ye mbakka iba ke atu mbonekọñ Isrel ekeben adidem ekaaña eboiyo Yọdan.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Ikikpeeneke, afịd mme ideen ke Isrel emaedi edisoobo ye adidem enyʌñ ebo anye ete, “Nsoo ikido yak nditọeka ñnyịn, ikọd Yuda, eyịp adidem enyọñ enyʌñ eben anye ye mbon esịd ufọk amọ ekaaña Yọdan eto edi, ye afịd ikọd mbonekọñ Defid?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Afịd ikọd Yuda emaebọọrọ mbon Isrel ebo ete, “Ñnyịn ikinam ntom sia adidem adooho ataa aduuk ñnyịn. Nsoo ido nọ ndufo eyat esịd ebaña anye? Nte ñnyịn imidia ñkpọ adidem ndomokeed? Nte ñnyịn imidat ñkpọ ndomokeed inọ idem ñnyịn?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Ndin ideen Isrel emaebọọrọ ideen Yuda ebo, “Ñnyịn imidinie ubaak udeeme duob ito adidem, awuọ ke ñnyịn iminie unen ke Defid ikan ndufo. Nsoo ido yak ndufo ise ñnyịn ke ndek? Idooho ñnyịn ikido akpa mbon eketañña ebo yak idiiben adidem ñnyịn inyọñ idi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Ado ideen mbon Yuda ekesʌk edọdiọñ eyịre ke akpọsọñ ebaña udeeme ammọ ekan ideen mbon Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Seba Asọñ Iwuod ye Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Amaaba awo ntịme keed a-akekereke Seba, ayịn Bikri, awo Benyamin, a-akebaaha do. Anye amaafịt adukpoñ anyʌñ abọñ ñkpo abo ate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">“Ñnyịn inieghe udeeme ke idem Defid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">inyʌññọ inie mbakka ke ayịn Yesi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">O Isrel, yak afịd awo enyọñọ atayad amọ!”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ndin afịd mbon Isrel emaekpọñ Defid ekappa ekeene Seba, ayịn Bikri. Ado mbon Yuda emaeda ye adidem ammọ; esaña tọọñọ ke Yọdan ekewuọ Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Ke ini Defid amaakenyọñ ikiwuọ akwere amọ ke Yeruselem, anye amaakoono ibaan esa duob a-anye akekpọññọ anịm abo nọ ese ñkpọ ebaña akwere adidem, adọñ ammọ ke ufọk anyʌñ anịm mbon ukpeme. Anye amaase ñkpọ abaña ammọ ado ikinieghe ewuana ye ammọ. Ekenịm ammọ ke ñkọbntem, tutu usen ñkpa ammọ, ammọ ekedʌñọ nte mme ebekpa.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Akem adidem amaabo Amasa ate, “Koot ideen Yuda yak edi ke iso mmi ke ufañ usen ita, afo ke idem mfo nyʌñ keene ba do.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ado Amasa akekaa adikikoono mbon Yuda ndi, anye amaakpeene akan ibad usen se adidem akenọọ anye.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Ke ntoro, Defid amaadọkkọ Abisai ate, “Idahami Seba, ayịn Bikri, ayainam ñnyịn idiọọk akan se Absalọm akenam. Koono ideen eteufọk mfo nyʌñ bịne anye, imiidooho ntoro anye ayaakịt mme ñkpọsọñ abio se anye afeghe akaa anyʌñ ibọkkọ ñnyịn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido anyʌñ anam ñnyịn ataa idiọọk ndoom</char></note>” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Ndin ideen Yoab ye mbon Kered ye Peled ye afịd mme ñkpọsọñ mbonekọñ emaewuọ eka ye Abisai nte adaaha ammọ. Ammọ emaeto ke Yeruselem esaña ewuọñọ ebịne Seba, ayịn Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Amasa amaakesoobo ye ammọ, ke idaha ammọ ekebaaha ke itie ekamba itiad ke Kibiọn. Yoab akesịne ewịra ekọñ amọ, anyʌñ abọbọ ñkpaha akesịneke ikwa ke efọk ke isịn amọ. Ikwa ado amaawuọ ke efọk aduọ ke isọñ, idaha anye akesañake akeda ke iso.<verse eid="2SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoab amaabịp Amasa ate, “Ayịneka mmi, abadie?” Akem Yoab amaadat ubọk amʌm ñwaebek Amasa ayem aditʌm anye inua. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Amasa ikikịtte ikwa ado ke ubọk Yoab, ndin Yoab amaakịm Amasa idịp, mme nsia amọ emaewuọñọ eduọññọ ke isọñ. Yoab ikikịmme anye aba ke Amasa akekpaaha. Akema, Yoab ye ayịneka amọ Abisai emaekaa iso ebịne Seba, ayịn Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Keed ke atu ikọd Yoab amaasọñ ada ke ñkañ Amasa abo ate, “Yak awo akeedodo a-amaaha Yoab, ye awo akeedodo a-adaaha ye Defid akeene Yoab!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa amaanaa amiañña ke iyiib amọ ke ufọọd akpọusʌñ, awo ado amaanyʌñ akịt abo ke afịd udịmekọñ emaetuak eda do. Ñko anye amaakekịt ibo ke afịd awo e-ekediighe adise Amasa emaesọñ eda, anye amaadʌt anye ke akpọusʌñ asịn ke inwañ anyʌñ atop afọñ afʌk anye. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Ke emaekeben Amasa isio ikpọñ akpọusʌñ, afịd awo emaekeene Yoab ekaa edibịne Seba ayịn Bikri.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Seba amaasaña aboiyo ke afịd mme esiin Isrel akewuọ Ebeel Bed Maaka anyʌñ afrọ ke afịd ukañ ñkanñkʌk mme Beria, e-ekesooboke idem ammọ itie keed ndin ekeene anye. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Afịd udịmekọñ se ikiba ye Yoab emaedikanna Seba a-abaaha ke Ebeel Bed Maaka ekʌk. Ammọ emaenyʌñ ebọp atañ akọ ekanna tutu akewuọ abio, ndin anye amaada abiọọñọ ubeed adaña anwa esiin abio. Ado ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ etuai ndibene eyem adiwuut, <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />awonwaan a-anieghe aniọñ amaato esịd abio abọñ akoot ate, “Ikpañ utọñ! Ikpañ utọñ! Ndufo idọkkọ Yoab yak adi mi nọ ato do ami ntañ ikọ ye anye.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoab amaasaña akpere anye, ndin mma ado amaabịp ate, “Afo ado Yoab?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Anye amaabọọrọ ate, “Ami ke ado.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Awonwaan ado amaabo ate, “Kpañ utọñ kop se awo mfo anie aditañ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoab amaabo, “Ami nsʌk ñkpañ utọñ.”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Awonwaan ado amaakaa iso abo, “Ke ataa anyan ini emaesibo ete, ‘Kaa Ebeel kebọ ibọọrọ,’ ndin ikọ akweeñe. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Ñnyịn ido mbon emem ye akpanikọ ke Isrel. Afo anwana adisobo abio a-adooho eka ke Isrel. Nsoo ido yak afo ayem adiben nsʌhọ udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmen?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoab amaabọọrọ ate, “Abasi akan! Abasi akan ami adimen me adisobo! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Idooho ntoro. Awo a-akereke Seba, ayịn Bikri, a-atooho idʌñ abod Ifrem, adịppe ubọk amọ anwana ye adidem, Defid. Sio awo ami yaak inọ ñnyịn, ndin ami ñyaawuọ ñkpọñ abio ami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Awonwaan ado amaadọkkọ Yoab ate, “Eyaeda ke ndibene etop iwuod amọ esuuhọ unọ fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Akem awonwaan ado amaakaa abịne afịd mme awo ke abio ye eti item amọ, ndin ammọ emaekpịkke iwuod Seba, ayịn Bikri, etop enọ Yoab. Ndin, Yoab amaafịt adukpoñ, ikọd amọ emaesuana enyọñọ ekpọñ abio ado. Yoab amaanyʌñ atịmme abịne adidem ke Yeruselem.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikpọ Mbon Utom Defid</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoab akedo adaiwuod anọ afịd mbonekọñ Isrel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:23">Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada akedo adaiwuod ke aduuk mbon Kered ye mbon Peled;<verse eid="2SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adọniram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin se ñko 1 Nd 4:6 ye 2 Sa 5:14; Ke Hibru ado Adọram</char></note> akedo adaiwuod akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña mbon akpaakpak utom;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:24">Yehosafad ayịn Ahilud akedo anamibad;<verse eid="2SA 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sefa akedo awedñwed;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 20:25">Sadọk ye Abiata ekedoñño mme aku;<verse eid="2SA 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />ñko Ira awo Yai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin ye Siriak (se ñko 2 Sa 23:38) Itraid</char></note> akedo aku anọ Defid.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Esio Mbon Kibiọn Usiene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Ke ini ukara Defid, akañ amaaba ke afịd isua ita; ndin Defid amaayem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Ato Sọọl ye ubon uduọkiyiib amọ; ado sia anye amaawoot mbon Kibiọn.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Adidem amaadọñ ekoot mbon Kibiọn edi, anye amaanyʌñ atañ ikọ ye ammọ (Mbon Kibiọn ikidooho aduuk Isrel, ado ammọ ekedoñño mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ ikọd Amọọ; nditọ Isrel emaenwọñọ edinịm ammọ uwem, ado Sọọl ke akpọsọñ udọñ a-anye akenieghe anọ Isrel ye Yuda amaanwana adiwot ammọ nsio). <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Defid amaabịp mbon Kibiọn ate, “Nsoo ke ami ñkpenam inọọ ndufo? Die ke ami ndiinam ñkpeubọk nọ ndufo ediọñ udeeme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Nditọ Kibiọn emaebọọrọ ete, “Ñnyịn inieghe unen edibịp silfa me kold nto Sọọl me ubon amọ, ñnyịn inyʌññọ inie unen adiwot awo ndomokeed ke Isrel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Defid amaamaana abịp ammọ ate, “Nsoo ke ndufo eyem nọ ami nnam inọ ndufo?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Ndin ammọ emaebọọrọ adidem ete, “Amaado awo a-akisoboke ñnyịn, akenyʌññọ adioomo abo yak esọọk ñnyịn mbaak ñnyịn idinie itie ndomokeed ke isọñ Isrel, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />yak esio nditọ ideen amọ itiaba inọ ñnyịn yak iwot, enyʌñ ebon akpo ammọ ke anwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Kibie ake Sọọl, ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akemekke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Ndin adidem amaabo ate, “Ami ñyaasio ammọ inọ ndufo.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Adidem amaafeen anọ Mefibosed, ayịn Yọnatan, ayịn Sọọl, ke ntak enwọñọ amọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ufọọd Defid ye Yọnatan, ayịn Sọọl. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Ado adidem amaaben Amọni ye Mefibosed, nditọ ideen iba ake Aiya, ayịn awonwaan Rispa, a-akemanna anọ Sọọl, adian ye nditọ ideen ition ake ayịn awonwaan Sọọl, Merab<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikpañwed Hibru iba, ikpañwed Septuakin ye Siriak (se ñko 1 Sa 18:19); ataa uwak ikpañwed Hibru ye Septuakin ado Mikal</char></note>, a-akemanna anọ Adriel, ayịn Basilai, ake Mehola. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Anye amaakappa ammọ anọ mbon Kibiọn, e-ekewotto ammọ enyʌñ ebon akpo ammọ ke anwa ke anyọñ abod ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Afịd ammọ awo itiaba ado emaeduọññọ ekpa itie keed; ekewot ammọ ke ini etọọñọke idọk, kpa ini etọọñọke adikpək baali.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Rispa, ayịn awonwaan Aiya amaadat afọñikpo akebịt anọ idem amọ ke anyọñ itiad. Ke ntọọñọ ini idọk tutu edịm aketo anyọñ adiduọkkọ mme akpo, anye ikiyakka mme inuen etuuk ammọ ke uweemeayio me ndiọi unam ke akonayio. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Ke emaekedọkkọ Defid se Rispa, ayịn awonwaan Aiya, anwaan esa Sọọl, akenam, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Defid amaakaa akebọ mme akpọ Sọọl ye ake ayịn amọ Yọnatan ato nditọ amanaisọñ Yabes Kilied. (Ammọ emaeyịp mme akpo ado eto anwa abio ke Bed San, ke itie mbon Filistia ekekọọñọ mme akpo ado, ke emaekewot Sọọl ke Kilboa). <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Defid amaakoono mme akpọ Sọọl ye ake ayịn amọ Yọnatan do, ñko emaenyʌñ ekoono mme akpọ mbon se ekewot enyʌñ ebon anwa-anwa ebok.<verse eid="2SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Emaebuuk mme akpọ Sọọl ye ake ayịn amọ Yọnatan ke itiad udi ete Sọọl, Kisi ke Sela ke Benyamin, enyʌñ enam afịd ñkpọ se adidem akebo yak enam. Ekema ado, Abasi amaabọọrọ akam ke isọñ ado.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekọñ ye mbon Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Ini keed mfen ekọñ amaatịppe ke ufọọd Filistia ye Isrel. Defid amaasọiyọ akaa akekeene ada ye ikọd amọ anwana ekọñ ye mbon Filistia, akem idem amaamem anye. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ndin Isbi-Benob, keed ke atu nditọnditọ Rafa, ake iwuod eduad brọns amọ akedoppoke sekel ikie ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.5</char></note>, akenyʌññọ akama ufa akañkañ, akebo ke iyaiwot Defid. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Ado Abisai, ayịn Seruya, amaadinyaaña Defid asio; anye amaatọ awo Filistia ado aduọọk (ke isọñ) anyʌñ awot anye. Akem ikọd Defid emaenwọñọ enọ Defid ete, “Akpa mme akpatre ado ami afo adiwuọ ye ñnyịn ikaa iso ekọñ, mbaak edinịme utuenikañ Isrel.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ke ini amaakeboiyo, anwan mfen amaaba ye mbon Filistia, ke Kob. Ke ini ado, Sibekai awo Husa amaawot Saf, keed ke atu mme ubon Rafa.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Ke ekọñ mfen ye mbon Filistia ke Kob, Elhanan ayịn Yaiye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke 1 Kr 20:5; Hibru ado Yaare-Orekịm.</char></note> ake Betlehem amaawot ayịneka awodeen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke 1 Kr 20:5; Hibru inieghe ayịneka awodeen amọ</char></note> Koloyad awo Kad, a-akenieghe eduad asañake ye adọọn a-akebaaha nte eto udọk afọñ.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Kpa ke iso ekọñ mfen, e-ekenwanake ke Kad, ekaa anyan awodeen keed amaaba a-akenieghe nnuunubọk itiokeed ke ubọk amọ naña iba ye nnuun ukod itiokeed ke ukod amọ naña iba, afịd akedo edịb mme inaañ. Anye ñko aketo ubon Rafa. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Ke ini anye akenọọhọ Isrel ñnyọọ, Yọnatan ayịn Simei, ayịneka awodeen Defid, amaawot anye.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Mme awo inaañ ami eketo ubon Rafa ke Kad, ndin ammọ emaekpañña ke ubọk Defid ye ikọd amọ.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ikwọ Itooro Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Defid akekwọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mme ikọ ikwọ ami ke ini <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenyaañake anye asio ke ubọk afịd mme asua amọ, ye ke ubọk Sọọl. <verse eid="2SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Anye akebo ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:2">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado akwa itiad mmi, itie udịbe mmi ye ubọkkọ mmi;<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Abasi mmi ado akwa itiad mmi, ke anye ke ami ndʌk ndịbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">atuekọñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido andikara</char></note> mmi ye nnʌk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnʌk ada anọ adudu.</char></note> adinyaaña mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Anye ado akpọsọñ ubọkkọ mmi, udịbe ye andiñnyaaña miin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">afo ameñnyaaña asio ke ubọk mbon afai.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />“Ami mmaakoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-adotto itooro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">ndin anye amañnyaaña miin asio ke ubọk mme asua mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Mme awawa ñkpa emaeñkanna miin ekʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">mme ukwọ nsobo emaemfuuk miin.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Mme udʌk udi emaeñkanna miin ekʌk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">mme afia ñkpa emaennaa miin ke iso.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />“Ke nnananyen mmi ami mmaakoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Ami mmaabọñ ñkoot Abasi mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Anye amaatie ke tembịd amọ akop uyio mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">uyio ñkpo mmi amaasịm anye utọñ.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Isọñ amaanyeñ anyʌñ anyeeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">mme itiad idakisọñ mme hefịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; Fulked ye Siriak (se ñko Saam 18:7) mme ikpọabod</char></note> emaenyeeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">ammọ emaenyeeñe sia anye amaayat esịd.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Nsʌñikañ amaawuọ anye ke aduiwuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">akwa ikañ amaanyʌñ awuọ anye ke inua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">eboho ikañ amaabịppe ato do asak.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Anye amaabakka mme hefịn anyʌñ asọiyọ adi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">ñkịm-ñkịm ntọñanyọñ amaaba anye ke idak ikpad.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Anye amaadoro ke anyọñ serubim anyʌñ afuurọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">anyʌñ afuurọ adọọk ke mba afịm.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Anye amaanam ekịm ado kanopi amọ akanna anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">mme ñkịm-ñkịm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin se ñko Saam 18:11; Hibru ado afiik abono</char></note> ntọñanyọñ edịm ke ikpaanyọñ.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Ato ke uyamma iso amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">mme eboho akebkeb emaebịmme ewuọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatuak ke anyọñ nte aduma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">uyio ataa Andikoñ Ñkan amaasakka;<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Anye amaatop idañ amọ anyʌñ asuan mme asua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">amaanyʌñ adọñ mme akpọsọñ akebkeb adisuan ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Mme abedeñ akpainyañ mmọọñ emaewuọñọ edudak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">ndin mme itiad idakisọñ ederimbod emaewuọñọ eda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">ke nduaiya ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">ke mfiara afịm ake aduiwuo amọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Anye amaatie ke anyọñ asio ubọk ammʌm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">anye amandʌt miin asio ke ntotəño mmọọñ.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Anye amamfak miin asio ke ubọk akpọsọñ asua mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ansio ke ubọk mme asua ekesọññọ adudu eñkan miin.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Ammọ emaetuaha ye ami ke usen ukuud mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akedo ibededem mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Anye amansio miin asịn ke ñnwaña uyaiya itie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">anye amamfak miin sia anye amaanem esịd ye ami.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam ye ami akeene adinenido mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">anye amannọ miin utịb akeene naña ubọk mmi asana.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Sia ami mmekpeme usʌñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">ami ndueghe ke adiwọññọ ñkpọñ Abasi mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Afịd mme mbed amọ enna miin ke iso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">ami ñwọññọke iso ñkpọñ mme ewʌhọ amọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ami mmenana ndo ke iso amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">ñnyʌñ nsio idem mmi ke usʌñ idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> annọ miin utịb akeene adinenido mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">akeene naña ubọk mmi asana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; Septuakin ye Fulked (se ñko Saam 18:24) kemme nsaana ubọk mmi</char></note> ke iso amọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Afo anam akpanikọ ye mbon se inam akpanikọ ye afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">afo awọt idem mfo nte anana ndo anọ mme anana ndo,<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />afo amenịm idem mfo ke adisana, ye mbon se isana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">ado ye mbon mbubịk, afo amewọt ñkara.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Afo anyaaña mbon ake esuuhọke idem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">Ado anyen mfo ase mbon ntañidem, adisuuhọ ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anam utuenikañ mmi asak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">ñko <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akappa ekịm mmi asịn ke unwana.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Ato ke unwam mfo ami mmekan ñnwana ye udịmekọñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">akan afeghe aboiyo ekpad ubiọọñọ</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ye Abasi mmi ami mmekan ntamma mfrọ akọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Amaado Abasi, usʌñ amọ afọn ama:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inieghe ndo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">anye ado atuekọñ anọ afịd mbon se idịbe ke anye.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Anie ado Abasi ke imiibọhọke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Anie ñko ido Itiad ke imiibọhọke Abasi ñnyịn?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Ado Abasi annọ miin adudu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikpañwed Ikpaikpa Akpainyañ, usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin, Fulked ye Siriak (se ñko Saam 18:32); ñwed Masoretik anye ado akpọsọñ ubọkkọ mmi</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">anyʌñ anam usʌñ mmi asọọñọ ada anen.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Anye anam ukod mmi aba nte ukod edob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">anye anam nọ ami nda ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Anye akpeep ubọk mmi anịm anọ usen ekọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">adọọn ubọk mmi akeme adinuuk utịgha brọns.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Afo anam adinyaaña unwam mfo ado atuekọñ mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">unwam mfo anam ami ñkpon.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Afo amenọ ikpad mmi ñnwaña-ñnwaña usʌñ isañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">mbaak itọñukod mmi adiyekke.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Ami mmaabịne mme asua mmi ñnyʌñ nnuak ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">ami ñkitịmmeke edem tutu esobo ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Ami mmaasọnnọ ammọ afịd-afịd, ndin ammọ ikanna idakka ida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">ammọ emaeduọññọ ke idak ikpad mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Afo amannọ miin adudu unwana ekọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">afo amaasuuhọ mbon usua mmi ke iso mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Afo amaanam mbon usua mmi etịmme edem efeeñe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">ndin ami mmaasobo mme asua mmi.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Ammọ emaetua eyem unwam, ado awo ikibaaha se inyaaña ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">emaekoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado anye ikibọọrọke ammọ.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Ami mmaanuak ammọ nọ edọrọ nte ntọñ isọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">ami mmaatịm ñnyʌñ nsọọk ammọ nte mbad ke efaak.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Afo ameñnyaaña miin asio ke ubịne mme awo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">afo ameñkpeme miin nte adaiwuod ke mme idịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Mme awo se ami mmiikidiọọñọke enam ñkpọ ennọ miin idahami,<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />mbon idịd mfen esuuk iwuod ke iso mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ ekokop uyio mmi, ammọ eñkpono miin.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Idem a-abọkkọ afịd ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">ammọ enyeñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin ye Fulked (se ñko Saam 18:45); ñwed Masoretik ammọ ekama ñkpọ ekọñ ammọ</char></note> idem ewuọñọ ke mme itie udịbe ammọ edi.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adu uwem! Itooro anie Itiad mmi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Yak edịppe Abasi mmi, Itiad, Andinyaaña mmi!<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Anye ado Abasi a-asioho usiene iwuod mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">a-asịnne mme abio ke ukara mmi,<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />a-amfakka miin asio ke ubọk mme asua mmi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">Afo amambenne miin nọ ñkoñ ñkan mme asua mmi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">amamfak asio ke ubọk awo afai.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Ke ntoro, ami ñyautooro fiin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke atu mme idịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">Ami ñyaakwọ mme itooro anyịñ mfo.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />“Anye anọ adidem amọ ekamba adikan, ado tọwa adinyaaña amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">anye awọt anye e-emaekeyet adan inịm mfọn mma ima amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">anọ Defid ye ubon amọ ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Akpatre Ikọ Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Mme akpatre ikọ Defid ekedo ami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">“Ikọ Defid ayịn Yesi aketañña ato ndadusʌñ Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">ikọ awo ake Ñkoñ Ñkan Abasi akedịppeke itie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">awo a-Abasi Yekọb akeyette adan anịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">ata ikwọ ke Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Sịbidịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ ikọ anto miin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">ikọ amọ akedoro ke edeme mmi.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Abasi Isrel amaatañ ikọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Akwa Itiad Isrel akendọkkọ miin abo ate:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Awo amaakara mbon awo ke adinenido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">anye amaakara ke mbaak Abasi,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />anye aba nte unwana ubakusen ke usakkautịn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">ke ubakusen a-ntọñanyọñ imiibaaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">nte unwana ke ini edịm amaabiide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">a-anamma yak mbid atịppe awuọ ke isọñ.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Adieke ufọk mmi imiikpikibaaha nnen-nnen ye Abasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ke akpanikọ anye ikpikinamma nsi-nsi edioomo ye ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">e-ekenamma enyʌñ esọọñọ enịm ke afịd idaha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">ke akpanikọ, anye ikpiyakka adinyaaña mmi anwịm mfịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">me adinnọ afịd udọñ mmi.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Ado ana esịññe mbon ibak eduọñọ nte eto ñkukịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">idiidooho se awo akoono ke ubọk.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Awo akeedodo atuuhọ eto ñkukịm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">akama ñkpọ ukwak me adọọn eduad;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">efọp ammọ ke itie nte ammọ enaa.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ñkpọsọñ Mbonekọñ Defid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Anyịñ mme ñkpọsọñ mbonekọñ Defid edoñño emi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Yoseb-Basebed,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin ebo ke ado Is-Bosed, a-adooho, Es-Baal (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:11 Yasobiim).</char></note> awo Takemọn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akeme ido usʌñ mfen naña ekoot awo Hakmon (se 1 Kr 11:11)</char></note> anye akedo abọọñ ke mme adaaha Ita; anye amaanwana anyʌñ awot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:11); ke Hibru ye mme ikpañwed Septuakin Ita; akedo Adino awo Esn akewot ideen 800</char></note> awo ikie itiaita (800) akañ keed ke iso ekọñ keed.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Andikidiana anye akedo Eliasa ayịn Dodai awo Ahoa. Nte awo keed ke atu mbon uko ekọñ ita, anye amaaba ye Defid idaha ammọ ekenọọhọ mbon Filistia e-ekebohoke ke Pas Damịm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Se ke 1 Kr 11:13; ke Hibru emaeboho do.</char></note> edinwana ekọñ ñnyọọ. Ndin mbon Isrel emaetịmme edem, <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />ado Eliasa amaasọñ ada anyʌñ awoot mbon Filistia tutu ubọk amem anye anyʌñ asọñ adiana ke akañkañ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Isrel ekamba adikan usen ado. Mbon ekọñ emaetịmme edikisoobo ye Eliasa, ado ekedi edikibịme mbịme ekọñ kpọd.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Awo a-akedianake anye akedo Saama, ayịn Akee, awo Hara. Ke ini mbon Filistia ekewuọhọ edibono ke itie keed ke itie inwañ a-akeyọhọke ye nsama, mbonekọñ Isrel emaefeeñe ke iso mbon Filistia. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Ado Saama amaasọọñọ ada ke ufọọd inwañ ado. Anye amaanwana anyʌñ awoot mbon Filistia, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Isrel ekamba edikan.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Ke ini idọk, awo ita ke atu mme ñkpọsọñ mbonekọñ edịb mme duob emaedikisoobo ye Defid ke abaitiad Adulam, ke ini mbon ekọñ Filistia ekenamma nnaaekọñ ekanna ke Abedeñ Refaim. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Ini ado Defid akeba ke akpọsọñ itie udịbe, ndin itie udịmekọñ Filistia akeba ke Betlehem. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Defid amaayem mmọọñ se anwọñ, ndin anye amaabo, “O, ubaha nte awo akpekoiyo mmọọñ annọ miin ke ube mmọọñ a-akpereke inuaatob Betlehem!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Ndin mme ñkpọsọñ mbonekọñ ita ado emaewuut eto adaña mbon Filistia, ekekoi mmọọñ ke ñkañ inuaatob ake Betlehem, enyʌñ eben esọk Defid. Ado anye amaasịn adinwọñ mmọọñ ado, anye amaakappa anwañña mmọọñ ado aduọk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Defid amaabo ate, “Nsaa mmi-o, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, adikpinam ntoro. Nte ami idooho iyiib ideen se ikinyịmme edikpikiduọọk uwem ammọ?” Ndin Defid ikinyịmmeke adinwọñ mmọọñ ado.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Uto mme utom uko mme ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ ado akedo ado.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abisai ayịneka awodeen Yoab, ayịn Seruya, akedo adaiwuod ke atu ñkpọsọñ mbonekọñ Ita.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ataa uwak ikpañwed Hibru (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:20); ikpañwed Hibru iba ye Siriak edịb mme duob</char></note> Anye amaakama eduad amọ anwana awo ikie ita (300) a-anye akewotto, ndin anye amaawuọ etob ukem nte ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ Ita. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Nte awo ikinọọhọ anye ukpono ikan mme awo Ita ado? Anye amaakappa ado adaiso ekọñ ammọ, akpesʌkado awo ikibatta anye isịn ke atu mbon ita ado.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, awo uko ke ekọñ a-aketooho Kabseel, amaanam mme awuọ etob ñkpoon utom uko. Anye amaawot ata ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ Mọb iba ekesọññọ adudu ekan. Anye amaanyʌñ asọiyọ adʌk ube ke usen sino akenekkeke aduọ awak akewot ekpe. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Anye ñko amaawot eka ukpịd awo Iyib. Akpesʌkado awo Iyib amaakekama eduad ke ubọk amọ, Benaiya amaasaña abịne anye ye akpeti. Anye amaawappa eduad asio ke ubọk awo Iyib ado anyʌñ akama kpa eduad awo ado awot anye. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Mme utọ ado ekedoñño mme ñwuọnda utom uko Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada; anye ñko amaanyʌñ awuọ etob nte mme ñkpọsọñ mbon ekọñ ita ado. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Emaenịm anye ke ataa ekamba itie ukpono ekan afịd mme awo edịb mme duob ado, ado awo ikisịnne anye ke atu mme ñkpọsọñ awo Ita ado. Ndin Defid amaanịm anye nte adaiwuod ke atu mbon ukpeme amọ.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Ke atu mbon edịb mme duob ami ekedoñño:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:24" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Asahel, ayịneka awodeen Yoab,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:24">Elhanan ayịn Dodo a-aketooho Betlehem,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Sama awo Harod,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:25">Elika awo Harod,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Heles awo Paltiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:26">Ira ayịn Ikes a-atooho Tekoa,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiesa a-atooho Anatod,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:27">Sibekai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk ikpañwed Septuakin (se ñko ke 2 Sa 21:18; 1 Kr 11:29); Ke Hibru Mebunad</char></note> awo Husa<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salmọn a-adooho awo Ahoa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:28">Maharai a-adooho awo Netofa,<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Heled<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk ikpañwed Hibru ye Fulked se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:30; ataa uwak ikpañwed ado Heleb</char></note> ayịn Baana awo Netofa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:29">Itai ayịn Ribai a-atooho Kibie ke Benyamin,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaiya awo Piratọn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:30">Hedayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:32) Hurat</char></note> a-atooho mme abedeñ Kaas,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abi-Albọn awo Abad,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:31">Asmafed awo Bahum,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliaba awo Saalbọn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">nditọ ideen Yasen,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:32">Yọnatan <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />ayịn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:34); Hibru inieghe ayịn ake. </char></note> Sama awo Hara,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:33">Ahiam ayịn Saraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibru; usʌk ikpañwed Septuakin (se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:35) Sakaa</char></note> awo Hara,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeled ayịn Ahasbai awo Maakad,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:34">Eliam ayịn Ahitofel awo Kilọ,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hesro awo Kamel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:35">Paarai awo Arb,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Ikal ayịn Natan a-atooho Soba,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:36">ayịn Hakri,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usʌk mme ikpañwed Septuakin se ñko ke 1 Kr 11:38; Hibru ado Hakadi</char></note><verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Selek awo Amọn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:37">Naharai awo Beerod, andikama ñkpọ ekọñ Yoab, ayịn Seruya,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ira awo Itriad,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2SA 23:38">Kareb awo Itriad,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />ye Yuria awo Hed.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2SA 23:39" />
  <para style="li4" vid="2SA 23:39">Afịd ammọ ekedoñño edịb mme duob mme itiaba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Defid Awet Mbonekọñ Anyịñ Asịn ke Ñwed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatịmme ademme ye Isrel, anye ñko amaadọọñ Defid nọ ado usʌñ ñkpọiduọ anọ ammọ, ate, “Ikaa ikinam ubadawo ke afịd Isrel ye Yuda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Ndin adidem amaabo Yoab ye mme adaiso ekọñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin (se ñko ke 2 Sam 24:4 ye 1 Kr 21:2); Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yoab ado etubom mbonekọñ.</char></note> ekebaaha ye anye ate, “Isaaña ke afịd esiin Isrel, tọọñọ ke Daan tutu akewuọ Beeseba inyʌñ iwet ibad ideen se ido mme anwana ekọñ, yak ami ndiọọñọ me ammọ edo awo ifañ.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Ado Yoab amaabọọrọ adidem ate, “Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo anam ibad mbonekọñ atọt akan akañ ikie, ñko yak anyen abọọñ mmi adidem anyʌñ akịt. Ado nsoo ido yak abọọñ mmi adidem ayem adinam utọ ñkpọ ami?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Ke akpatre, uyio adidem amaasọñ ada akan ake Yoab ye ake mme adaiso ekọñ; ndin ammọ emaekpọñ iso adidem ekaa adikibat mbon unwana ekọñ ke Isrel.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Ammọ emaekekaaña eboiyo Yọdan, emaenam nnaaekọñ ekpere Arowa, ke usuuk usʌñ abio ado, ndin esaña eboiyo Kad ekewuọ Yasa. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Ammọ emaekaa Kilied ye ñkanñkʌk Tatịm Hodsi, ye Daan Yaan enyʌñ ekanna ekpere Sidọn. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Akem ammọ emaekaa ñkañ akpọsọñ itie Tai ye afịd mme abio Hif ye Kenan. Ke akpatre ammọ emaekaa Beeseba ke Nekef ke Yuda.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Ke ammọ emaekesaña ekanna afịd isọñ abio, ammọ emaetịmme enyọñ Yeruselem ke utịd afiọñ usʌkkeed mme usen edịb.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoab amaakedọkkọ adidem ibad ideen se ido mme anwanaekọñ: ke Isrel, tọsịn ikie itiaita (800,000) ekekop adudu, ekekemekke ikama akañkañ, ndin ke Yuda akedo tọsịn ikie ition (500,000).<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Ado esịd amaabʌññọ Defid ke anye amaakebat mme anwanaekọñ, ndin anye amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Ami mmenam ekamba idiọọkñkpọ ke se nnam ami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mbọk, mmuukpeiye mbo yak aben ukwaññkpọ awo mfo afep. Sia ami mmenam ataa ndisịme ido.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Mbemiso Defid akedemme ubakusen, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm prọfed Kad, akịdñkukịd nnọọ Defid: <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Kaa kedọkkọ Defid, ‘Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: Ami unọ fiin usʌñ ñkpọ ita. Mek keed ke atu ammọ sio se ami mben umia fiin ufen.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Ndin Kad amaakaa abịne Defid akebo anye, “Afo ayem akañ aba ke isọñ mfo ke isua ita?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Septuakin (se ñko <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 21:12">1Krọn 21:12</ref></char>); Hibru </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">itiaba.</char></note> Me ayem ifeghe itọk ke afiọñ ita ñkpọñ mme asua mfo ke ammọ esʌkkọ ubịne fiin? Me ayem udọñọ nsobo ke usen ita ke isọñ mfo? Tịm kere idaha ado, nyʌñ mek naña ami ndiikibọọrọ andikindọñ miin utom.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Defid amaabo Kad, “Ami mba ke ataa ekamba mfʌhọ. Yak ñnyịn iduọ idʌk ubọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia mbọm amọ akpon; ado kuuyak ami nduọ ndʌk ubọk awo.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọñ udọñọ nsobo asịn ke isọñ Isrel tọọñọ ke ubakusen ado tutu awuọ utịd ini e-ekebiereke, ndin awo tọsịn ata mme duob (70,000) emaekpañña tọọñọ ke Daan tutu akesịm Beeseba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Idaha enyere akesioho ubọk anyan adisobo Yeruselem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop mbọm abaña idiọọk ido ado anyʌñ adọkkọ enyere akewotto mme awo do abo, “Akem! Dʌt ubọk mfo sio.” Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeba idaha ado ke afe ubeek abakpa Arauna, awo Yebus.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Defid akekịt enyere akewotto mbon awo, anye amaabo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ate, “Ami mmedue; ami, akpemeedọñ, mmenam idiọọkñkpọ. Mbon awo ami edo mme edọñ. Nsoo ke ammọ enam? Yak ubọk mfo andoro miin ye ufọk mmi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid Abọp Akpokoro Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Kad amaabịne Defid ke usen ado akebo anye ate, “Dọọk kaa ke bọp akpokoro uwa nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afe ubeek abakpa Arauna, awo Yebus.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Ndin Defid amaadọọk akaa, nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ uyio ato Kad. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Arauna akebenne anyen ase anyʌñ akịt nte adidem ye mme adaaha amọ esaña edikpere anye, anye amaawuọ akaa aketuak iwuod ke iso adidem, atuuk iso amọ ke isọñ.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Ndin Arauna amaabo, “Nsoo ido nọ abọọñ mmi adidem adi ufọk ayịnufọk amọ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Defid amaabọọrọ ate, “Ndi adidep afe ubeek abakpa mfo, nọ ndat mbọp akpokoro uwa nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, yak udọñọ nsobo a-awotto mme awo atre.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Arauna amaabo Defid ate, “Yak abọọñ mmi adidem adat se anye akpeyeyem aben awa anọ Abasi. Se mme ñyaaraenañ ufọfọb uwa mi, nyʌñ se mme akpeti ubeek abakpa ye mme akpọnọ enañ nte ifia mi. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />O Adidem, Arauna anọ adidem afịd mme ñkpọ ami. Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ubọ fiin.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Ado adidem amaabọọrọ Arauna ate, “Iyoo, ana ami ñkpe ekọmudua amọ ke itie isọñ ami. Ami ndiiwaaha ufọfọb uwa nnọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi ake imiñkpaaha miin ñkpọ ndomokeed.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Do ndin Defid amaadep afe ubeek abakpa ye mme abaakenañ ado, anyʌñ akpe sekel silfa aba mme duob ke iwuod amọ. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Defid amaabọp akpokoro uwa ke ndo anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ awa mme ufọfọb uwa ye uwa adiwuanakeed. Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabọọrọ akam amọ ke iwuod mbon awo ke abio ndin udọñọ nsobo ke Isrel amaatre.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>